    thinking: "**Building the UI Components**\n\nI\'ve got a solid foundation with all six tests passing swiftly, taking only 208ms! I\'m now transitioning to the front-end, aiming for a rich user interface. I\'m starting with the `src/components/Header.tsx`, focusing on the \"Bhasha Setu\" branding, and integrating language selection using dropdowns or pills, considering Santali, Ho, and Mundari.\n\n\n**Designing the UI Elements**\n\nNow, I\'m diving into designing individual UI elements. I\'m focusing on the component that has a script selector for languages with multiple scripts, like Ho and Santali. I\'m also planning to implement a bridge language toggle, a star counter with badge and sticker book access, and controls for sound, high-contrast mode, and teacher portal access. Additionally, I\'m working on an animated mascot, \"Chotu,\" a deer character that can blink, wave, and speak with speech synthesis. Finally, I\'m designing a welcome screen with language selection cards.\n\n\n**Adding Audio and Visuals**\n\nI\'m now integrating audio and visuals to enhance the user experience, particularly for young learners. Each language selection card will feature an audio greeting, such as \"Johar! Santali te parhaome.\" I\'m also including a \"Start Adventure\" button. Within `src/components/ClassSelector.tsx`, I am crafting five large animal-themed buttons, complete with animal sounds on tap. `src/components/SubjectSelector.tsx` will feature animated icons and audio cues. Finally, I\'m visualizing a chapter map as a winding path through a Jharkhand Sal forest, with stepping stones.\n\n\n**Developing Interactive Stories**\n\nI\'m now focusing on interactive lesson slides with synchronized audio narration and highlighted words. I\'m building out a story/cartoon scene viewer (`StoryAnimation.tsx`) that features animated SVG characters. I\'m also adding action buttons like audio controls and \"Ask Chotu,\" as well as \"Report Translation.\" I\'m working on specific scenes for Class 1 Maths Ch 1 concepts, like rolling and sliding animations.\n\n\n**Expanding Game Functionality**\n\nI\'m now bringing more interactivity to the game hub. I\'ve programmed animals to bounce and speak their names, adding instant audio feedback when tapped. I\'m also developing the core components for the games, including `DragDropGame.tsx`, `MatchingGame.tsx`, `CountingGame.tsx`, `TracingGame.tsx`, and `QuizGame.tsx`, making them ready for implementation. Finally, I\'m working on the `ChatbotModal.tsx`, \"Ask Chotu,\" a multilingual AI chatbot that can speak and provide audio playback of its replies, but is honest about its vocabulary limitations, leveraging the school\'s glossary and the Gemini API, with local fallback. The sticker book component is also in development.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_160899"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  Volume2,\\n  VolumeX,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  Sun,\\n  ShieldCheck,\\n  AlertCircle,\\n  HelpCircle,\\n  BookOpen,\\n  ArrowLeft,\\n  GraduationCap,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { LanguageId, ScriptMode, BridgeMode } from \'../types\';\\nimport { LANGUAGES, ACTIVE_LANGUAGES } from \'../data/languages\';\\nimport { sound } from \'../utils/audio\';\\n\\ninterface HeaderProps {\\n  currentLanguage: LanguageId;\\n  onLanguageChange: (lang: LanguageId) => void;\\n  activeScript: ScriptMode;\\n  onScriptChange: (script: ScriptMode) => void;\\n  bridgeMode: BridgeMode;\\n  onBridgeModeChange: (mode: BridgeMode) => void;\\n  starsCount: number;\\n  onOpenStickerBook: () => void;\\n  soundEnabled: boolean;\\n  onToggleSound: () => void;\\n  highContrast: boolean;\\n  onToggleHighContrast: () => void;\\n  onOpenTeacherPortal: () => void;\\n  onOpenReportModal: () => void;\\n  onOpenChatbot: () => void;\\n  canGoBack?: boolean;\\n  onGoBack?: () => void;\\n  currentScreenTitle?: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport const Header: React.FC<HeaderProps> = ({\\n  currentLanguage,\\n  onLanguageChange,\\n  activeScript,\\n  onScriptChange,\\n  bridgeMode,\\n  onBridgeModeChange,\\n  starsCount,\\n  onOpenStickerBook,\\n  soundEnabled,\\n  onToggleSound,\\n  highContrast,\\n  onToggleHighContrast,\\n  onOpenTeacherPortal,\\n  onOpenReportModal,\\n  onOpenChatbot,\\n  canGoBack,\\n  onGoBack,\\n  currentScreenTitle,\\n}) => {\\n  const langConfig = LANGUAGES[currentLanguage];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <header className=\\\"sticky top-0 z-40 bg-amber-100/95 backdrop-blur-md border-b-4 border-amber-300 shadow-md px-3 sm:px-6 py-2.5 transition-colors\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n        {/* Left: Back button or Logo */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n          {canGoBack && onGoBack ? (\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                sound.playPop();\\n                onGoBack();\\n              }}\\n              className=\\\"p-2 sm:px-3 sm:py-2 bg-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-500 text-amber-950 font-bold rounded-2xl flex items-center gap-1 shadow-sm press-bounce border-2 border-amber-600\\\"\\n              aria-label=\\\"Go back to previous screen\\\"\\n            >\\n              <ArrowLeft className=\\\"w-5 h-5\\\" />\\n              <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline text-sm\\\">Back</span>\\n            </button>\\n          ) : null}\\n\\n          <div\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer select-none\\\"\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              sound.playPop();\\n              if (onGoBack) onGoBack();\\n            }}\\n          >\\n            <div className=\\\"w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-400 to-orange-500 p-0.5 shadow-md flex items-center justify-center text-xl animate-gentle-bounce border-2 border-amber-600\\\">\\n              \360\237\246\214\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <h1 className=\\\"text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-amber-950 tracking-tight leading-none flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n                Bhasha Setu\\n                <span className=\\\"text-xs bg-emerald-600 text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold uppercase tracking-wider\\\">\\n                  JCERT\\n                </span>\\n              </h1>\\n              <p className=\\\"text-xs text-amber-800 font-semibold truncate max-w-[150px] sm:max-w-none\\\">\\n                {currentScreenTitle || \'\340\244\235\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\226\340\244\202\340\244\241 \340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\244\340\245\203\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276 \340\244\266\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\267\340\244\276 (Classes 1-5)\'}\\n              </p>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Center: Language & Script Selectors */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center flex-wrap gap-1.5 sm:gap-2\\\">\\n          {/* Language Switcher */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center bg-white/90 p-1 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-300 shadow-inner\\\">\\n            {ACTIVE_LANGUAGES.map((lang) => {\\n              const isSelected = lang.id === currentLanguage;\\n              return (\\n                <button\\n                  key={lang.id}\\n                  onClick={() => {\\n                    sound.playPop();\\n                    onLanguageChange(lang.id);\\n                  }}\\n                  className={`px-2.5 py-1 sm:px-3 sm:py-1.5 rounded-xl text-xs sm:text-sm font-extrabold transition-all flex items-center gap-1 ${\\n                    isSelected\\n                      ? \'bg-amber-500 text-white shadow-sm scale-105\'\\n                      : \'text-amber-900 hover:bg-amber-100\'\\n                  }`}\\n                  aria-label={`Select language ${lang.name}`}\\n                >\\n                  <span>{lang.iconEmoji}</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-bold\\\">{lang.name}</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"hidden md:inline opacity-80 text-[11px]\\\">({lang.nativeName})</span>\\n                </button>\\n              );\\n            })}\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Script Mode Selector (if language has multiple scripts, e.g. Ho: Warang Chiti / Devanagari / Roman) */}\\n          {langConfig.scriptsAvailable.length > 1 && (\\n            <div className=\\\"hidden lg:flex items-center bg-white/80 p-0.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-300 text-xs\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"px-1.5 text-amber-800 font-semibold text-[11px]\\\">Script:</span>\\n              {langConfig.scriptsAvailable.map((scr) => (\\n                <button\\n                  key={scr}\\n                  onClick={() => {\\n                    sound.playPop();\\n                    onScriptChange(scr);\\n                  }}\\n                  className={`px-2 py-0.5 rounded-lg font-bold capitalize text-xs ${\\n                    activeScript === scr\\n                      ? \'bg-amber-500 text-white\'\\n                      : \'text-amber-900 hover:bg-amber-100\'\\n                  }`}\\n                >\\n                  {scr === \'warangchiti\'\\n                    ? \'Warang Chiti\'\\n                    : scr === \'olchiki\'\\n                    ? \'Ol Chiki\'\\n                    : scr === \'devanagari\'\\n                    ? \'Devanagari\'\\n                    : scr}\\n                </button>\\n              ))}\\n            </div>\\n          )}\\n\\n          {/* Bridge Language Toggle (Mother Tongue / Hindi / English) */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center bg-amber-200/80 p-0.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-400 text-xs\\\">\\n            <button\\n              onClick={() => {\\n                sound.playPop();\\n                onBridgeModeChange(\\n                  bridgeMode === \'mother-tongue\'\\n                    ? \'hindi\'\\n                    : bridgeMode === \'hindi\'\\n                    ? \'english\'\\n                    : \'mother-tongue\'\\n                );\\n              }}\\n              className=\\\"px-2 py-1 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 hover:bg-white text-amber-900 font-bold flex items-center gap-1 shadow-xs\\\"\\n              title=\\\"Toggle Bridge Language (Mother Tongue / Hindi / English)\\\"\\n            >\\n              <BookOpen className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-700\\\" />\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide\\\">\\n                Bridge: <span className=\\\"text-emerald-700 font-extrabold\\\">{bridgeMode}</span>\\n              </span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Right: Actions, Star Rewards & Accessibility */}\\n        <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2\\\">\\n          {/* Star Reward & Sticker Book button */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              sound.playCorrect();\\n              onOpenStickerBook();\\n            }}\\n            className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-yellow-300 hover:from-amber-500 hover:to-yellow-400 text-amber-950 font-black rounded-2xl border-2 border-yellow-500 shadow-sm press-bounce text-xs sm:text-sm\\\"\\n            aria-label={`You have ${starsCount} stars. Open sticker collection.`}\\n          >\\n            <Sparkles className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-800 animate-spin\\\" style={{ animationDuration: \'6s\' }} />\\n            <span>\342\255\220 {starsCount}</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden sm:inline text-xs font-bold text-amber-800\\\">Stickers</span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Ask Chotu Mascot Bot Shortcut */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              sound.playPop();\\n              onOpenChatbot();\\n            }}\\n            className=\\\"p-2 sm:px-2.5 sm:py-1.5 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-2xl font-bold flex items-center gap-1 shadow-sm press-bounce border-2 border-emerald-700 text-xs\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Ask Chotu AI Chatbot\\\"\\n          >\\n            <span className=\\\"text-sm\\\">\360\237\246\214</span>\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden md:inline\\\">Ask Chotu</span>\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Sound Toggle */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              sound.playPop();\\n              onToggleSound();\\n            }}\\n            className={`p-2 rounded-2xl border-2 press-bounce transition-colors ${\\n              soundEnabled\\n                ? \'bg-amber-200 text-amber-900 border-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-300\'\\n                : \'bg-stone-200 text-stone-500 border-stone-300\'\\n            }`}\\n            aria-label={soundEnabled ? \'Mute sound effects\' : \'Unmute sound effects\'}\\n          >\\n            {soundEnabled ? <Volume2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" /> : <VolumeX className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />}\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* High Contrast Mode Toggle */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              sound.playPop();\\n              onToggleHighContrast();\\n            }}\\n            className={`p-2 rounded-2xl border-2 press-bounce transition-colors ${\\n              highContrast\\n                ? \'bg-stone-900 text-yellow-300 border-yellow-400\'\\n                : \'bg-amber-200 text-amber-900 border-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-300\'\\n            }`}\\n            aria-label={highContrast ? \'Disable high contrast\' : \'Enable high contrast\'}\\n            title=\\\"High Contrast Mode\\\"\\n          >\\n            <Sun className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Report wrong translation */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              sound.playPop();\\n              onOpenReportModal();\\n            }}\\n            className=\\\"p-2 bg-orange-100 hover:bg-orange-200 text-orange-800 rounded-2xl border border-orange-300 press-bounce\\\"\\n            title=\\\"Report wrong translation to teacher review queue\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Report translation error\\\"\\n          >\\n            <AlertCircle className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n          </button>\\n\\n          {/* Teacher Portal switch */}\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => {\\n              sound.playPop();\\n              onOpenTeacherPortal();\\n            }}\\n            className=\\\"p-2 sm:px-2.5 sm:py-1.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white rounded-2xl font-bold flex items-center gap-1 shadow-sm press-bounce border border-blue-800 text-xs\\\"\\n            aria-label=\\\"Teacher and Admin Panel\\\"\\n            title=\\\"Teacher Portal\\\"\\n          >\\n            <GraduationCap className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            <span className=\\\"hidden xl:inline\\\">Teacher</span>\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </header>\\n  );\\n};\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create multilingual header with language switcher, script toggles, bridge mode, star rewards, and accessibility controls\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/Header.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating Header.tsx\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create multilingual Header component\"}"
