    summary: "The Noto Sans Warang Citi font, available in TTF format, can be found on GitHub as part of the Noto Project. The notofonts/warang-citi repository on GitHub is dedicated to this specific font.[1] While the `noto-fonts` repository was archived in January 2023 and is now read-only[2], the `notofonts/warang-citi` repository is still actively building fonts automatically via GitHub Actions.[1] Users can look in the \"Actions\" tab of that repository for the latest builds.[1] The font is licensed under SIL OFL 1.1 and can be used for both commercial and non-commercial purposes.[3] It supports 55 languages.[3]\n\nSources:\n[1] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGSH3PItj-MM0j_Ew18lYtBh-HVc-jujNEVU25azTnU6GQMieabpclDRYJljaOFY2C7zDHOxdM9vEiXDzDUICOnARWvIla5OEp8staST9yiceXQvxqq17Pw9VI_P16Lfn6heA==)\n[2] [github.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEml4RckH8x8_Nw4SxIMptw-YxVTbf7um2l4keg3Tfq7D9W-G94mKYItWg_1zOgPjCHkZvvP7SNXdaDNu5I1f4KLfUXqxh90C8ZTS6njAeUZyFJWtSs3ugSSoEEsMhqewEl5s4aVgc-wi2Dko-hSrCUk6-w6whvFp-2aPaNWKWxIh2qZhQL5y4yM4Nqbdw2R8JBGn9LRAKOR9ozCBvQyyAPjgEehq8T2fip2ASo)\n[3] [online-fonts.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHL34pIzLbxTZFFL3B79AHV_Vhlgl-SjP4BoYh2BXpI_uscmyD8o-Jr4wxplT_Unf4CThi6fvXeps4QFpDCcgco0y6nQbAMDij60S28vqSiWR0_CDs23fRXav5jjIPFdR0g_S327rO_VI_GQNMz-g==)"
