  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Observing Renderings**\n\nI\'ve noted the Ol Chiki and Warang Chiti scripts rendering as expected in the mobile screenshot. The Devanagari script is also correctly displayed. I\'m pleased with the accuracy of these initial renderings, especially for less common scripts.\n\n\n**Addressing Font Deficiencies**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed a crucial design oversight. The lack of specific font declarations for Ol Chiki and Warang Chiti within the speech bubble and pills led to box characters in the rendering, showing that the default font couldn\'t display these glyphs. This is a critical insight. To solve this, I\'m proposing a comprehensive CSS solution, including a layer base. It utilizes a custom `--font-cartoon` variable to specify a font stack that includes `Noto Sans Ol Chiki`, `Noto Sans Warang Chiti`, and other appropriate fonts.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_140810"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@font-face {\\n  font-family: \'Noto Sans Warang Chiti\';\\n  src: url(\'/fonts/NotoSansWarangCiti-Regular.ttf\') format(\'truetype\');\\n  font-weight: 100 900;\\n  font-style: normal;\\n  font-display: swap;\\n}\\n\\n@font-face {\\n  font-family: \'Noto Sans Warang Citi\';\\n  src: url(\'/fonts/NotoSansWarangCiti-Regular.ttf\') format(\'truetype\');\\n  font-weight: 100 900;\\n  font-style: normal;\\n  font-display: swap;\\n}\\n\\n@layer base {\\n  :root {\\n    --font-cartoon: \'Baloo 2\', \'Noto Sans Ol Chiki\', \'Noto Sans Warang Chiti\', \'Noto Sans Warang Citi\', \'Noto Sans Devanagari\', \'Fredoka\', cursive, sans-serif;\\n    --font-olchiki: \'Noto Sans Ol Chiki\', \'Baloo 2\', sans-serif;\\n    --font-warangchiti: \'Noto Sans Warang Chiti\', \'Noto Sans Warang Citi\', \'Baloo 2\', sans-serif;\\n    --font-devanagari: \'Baloo 2\', \'Noto Sans Devanagari\', sans-serif;\\n  }\\n\\n  body {\\n    font-family: \'Baloo 2\', \'Noto Sans Ol Chiki\', \'Noto Sans Warang Chiti\', \'Noto Sans Warang Citi\', \'Noto Sans Devanagari\', \'Fredoka\', cursive, sans-serif;\\n    user-select: none;\\n    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom script fonts */\\n.font-olchiki {\\n  font-family: \'Noto Sans Ol Chiki\', \'Baloo 2\', sans-serif;\\n}\\n\\n.font-warangchiti {\\n  font-family: \'Noto Sans Warang Chiti\', \'Noto Sans Warang Citi\', \'Baloo 2\', sans-serif;\\n}\\n\\n.font-devanagari {\\n  font-family: \'Baloo 2\', \'Noto Sans Devanagari\', sans-serif;\\n}\\n\\n.font-cartoon {\\n  font-family: \'Baloo 2\', \'Noto Sans Ol Chiki\', \'Noto Sans Warang Chiti\', \'Noto Sans Warang Citi\', \'Noto Sans Devanagari\', \'Fredoka\', cursive, sans-serif;\\n}\\n\\n/* Children\'s Cartoon Floating & Bouncing Animations */\\n@keyframes gentle-bounce {\\n  0%, 100% {\\n    transform: translateY(0);\\n  }\\n  50% {\\n    transform: translateY(-8px);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes float-cloud {\\n  0% {\\n    transform: translateX(-10%);\\n  }\\n  50% {\\n    transform: translateX(10%);\\n  }\\n  100% {\\n    transform: translateX(-10%);\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes wiggle {\\n  0%, 100% { transform: rotate(0deg); }\\n  25% { transform: rotate(-3deg); }\\n  75% { transform: rotate(3deg); }\\n}\\n\\n@keyframes pulse-soft {\\n  0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }\\n  50% { transform: scale(1.04); }\\n}\\n\\n.animate-gentle-bounce {\\n  animation: gentle-bounce 2.6s ease-in-out infinite;\\n}\\n\\n.animate-wiggle {\\n  animation: wiggle 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;\\n}\\n\\n.animate-pulse-soft {\\n  animation: pulse-soft 2s ease-in-out infinite;\\n}\\n\\n.animate-float-slow {\\n  animation: float-cloud 20s ease-in-out infinite;\\n}\\n\\n/* Touch friendly button active press feedback */\\n.press-bounce {\\n  transition: transform 0.1s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), box-shadow 0.1s ease;\\n}\\n.press-bounce:active {\\n  transform: translateY(4px) scale(0.97);\\n}\\n\\n/* High contrast mode */\\n.high-contrast {\\n  filter: contrast(135%);\\n}\\n\\n.high-contrast * {\\n  border-width: max(2px, border-width) !important;\\n}\\n\\n/* Accessibility: reduce motion support */\\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\\n  *, ::before, ::after {\\n    animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;\\n    animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;\\n    transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;\\n    scroll-behavior: auto !important;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom scrollbars */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 8px;\\n  height: 8px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: #fef3c7;\\n  border-radius: 9999px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: #f59e0b;\\n  border-radius: 9999px;\\n}\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: #d97706;\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Include tribal fonts in global font fallback chain so glyphs never render as boxes\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating index.css font stack\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update global font stack with tribal fallbacks\"}"
