      result: "VERDICT: PASS\n\n### Summary\nThe live applet demonstrates exceptional visual fidelity, thematic alignment, and functional UX tailored specifically for Jharkhand tribal primary school learners.\n\n### Highlights\n- **Script & Typography Integrity**: Ol Chiki Unicode script renders crisply alongside Roman transliteration and Hindi bridge text without character clipping, glyph fallback boxes, or font overlaps.\n- **Child-Friendly Accessibility & Layout**: Clear, high-contrast, rounded touch targets suitable for low-cost Android tablets and phones. The dual interaction mode (\"Tap an item, then tap zone\" alongside drag-and-drop) provides great usability on mobile touchscreens.\n- **Curriculum & Feature Completeness**: Directly grounds Class 1 Mathematics (JCERT spatial concepts: Inside/Outside, Unt, Lantin, Pati, Sarjom) with 5 game modalities, language switcher (Santali, Ho, Mundari), bridge toggles, \"Ask Chotu\" AI mascot helper, and teacher dashboard access."
