    model_api_content_id: "6HTXarLFIavX_uMPo_Gf8Qs"
  }
  planner_response {
    response: "### Bhasha Setu (\341\261\265\341\261\267\341\261\237\341\261\245\341\261\237 \341\261\245\341\261\256\341\261\233\341\261\251 / \360\221\242\252\360\221\243\201\360\221\243\236\360\221\243\201 \360\221\242\267\360\221\243\210\360\221\243\225\360\221\243\203 / \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276 \340\244\270\340\245\207\340\244\244\340\245\201)\n\n**Bhasha Setu** is an animated mother-tongue primary learning application built for tribal children in Jharkhand schools (Classes 1 to 5), supporting **SDG 4: Quality Education**.\n\n---\n\n### What Has Been Built & Verified\n\n1. **All Three Required Tribal Languages & Scripts**:\n   - **Santali**: Native **Ol Chiki** (Unicode) with Roman transliteration.\n   - **Ho**: Native **Warang Chiti** (Unicode) with dual **Devanagari** and Roman transliteration.\n   - **Mundari**: Native **Devanagari** script with Roman and Mundari Bani options.\n   - **Bridge Languages**: Instant one-tap toggle between **Mother Tongue**, **Hindi**, and **English** so children transition naturally without losing conceptual context.\n   - **Extensible Architecture**: Built-in support for Kurukh (\340\244\225\340\245\201\340\244\241\340\244\274\340\245\201\340\244\226\340\244\274) and Khortha (\340\244\226\340\245\213\340\244\260\340\244\240\340\244\276) without any code modifications.\n\n2. **Official JCERT Jharkhand Curriculum**:\n   - Strictly mapped to official JCERT textbooks for Classes 1 to 5 (*\340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\246\340\245\202*, *\340\244\235\340\244\277\340\244\262\340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\262*, *\340\244\206\340\244\270-\340\244\252\340\244\276\340\244\270*, *Sunshine*).\n   - **Quality Benchmark Chapter (Class 1 Maths Ch 1: \"\340\244\206\340\244\225\340\245\203\340\244\244\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\201 \340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\245\340\244\276\340\244\250\" / Shapes & Space)**: Complete end-to-end implementation with inside/outside (*Bhitri/Bahre*), big/small (*Marang/Katij*), top/bottom (*Chetan/Latar*), and rolling/sliding (*Gudrau/Sidur*).\n\n3. **Children\'s Cartoon World & Interactive Animated Scenes**:\n   - **Chotu the Deer Mascot**: Animated guide with cheerful ear wiggles, blinking eyes, speech bubbles, and voice synthesis.\n   - **Interactive Story Scenes**: Desert camp with moving camel (*Unt*) in and out of the tent (*Tambu*), giant elephant vs small puppy, bird on Sal tree, and rolling ball vs sliding block.\n   - **Synchronized Audio Narration**: Word-by-word highlighted text synchronized with speech audio.\n\n4. **Five Reusable Interactive Game Engines**:\n   - **Drag & Drop**: Sort items inside the tent vs outside in the forest.\n   - **Matching Pairs**: Connect pictures to native script words with audio pronunciation.\n   - **Counting**: Count forest deer, sal trees, and wild mangoes in mother-tongue numerals (1 to 5).\n   - **Letter Tracing**: Finger/mouse touch canvas for tracing Ol Chiki (`\341\261\232`), Warang Chiti (`\360\221\242\271`), and Devanagari (`\340\244\205`).\n   - **Picture Quiz**: Visual multiple-choice challenges with instant feedback and confetti celebrations.\n\n5. **\"Ask Chotu\" AI Mascot Chatbot**:\n   - Knows the active class, subject, and chapter.\n   - Answers doubts in Santali, Ho, Mundari, Hindi, or English.\n   - Built-in child safety filters, honest vocabulary boundaries for low-resource scripts, and speech playback.\n\n6. **Teacher & Linguistic Review Panel**:\n   - **Review Queue**: Audit AI drafts, edit script text and transliterations, and record/upload native-speaker audio.\n   - **Student Feedback Tracker**: Review and resolve flagged translation issues.\n   - **Classroom Analytics**: Chapter completion rates and common mistake metrics.\n   - **AI4Bharat / Bhashini Dataset Export**: One-click download of verified multilingual sentences and school terminology in JSON format.\n\n7. **PWA & Offline Capability**:\n   - Web App Manifest (`manifest.webmanifest`), custom SVG icon, and Service Worker (`sw.js`) caching for offline classroom devices.\n\n---\n\n### Verification Summary\n- **Logic Tests**: 6 unit test suites covering drag validation, pair matching, star rewards, sticker unlocks, and font styling passed natively via `node --test` (0 failures).\n- **Visual Audits**: Verified via browser captures on desktop (1440\303\227900) and mobile (390\303\227844) viewports. Tested font rendering for Ol Chiki, Warang Chiti, and Devanagari, animated cartoon scenes, lesson narration, games hub, chatbot dialog, and sticker collection."
