    summary: "The Jharkhand Council of Educational Research and Training (JCERT) publishes textbooks for students from Class 1 to Class 12, which are essential study materials for those under the Jharkhand Board[1][2]. These textbooks are available for download in PDF format for various classes, including Classes 1 through 5[1][3][2][4].\n\nJCERT\'s primary role is to support and advise the state government on policies and programs to improve the quality of school education in Jharkhand, and it uses advanced techniques to develop curriculums and study materials that are kept up-to-date with contemporary advancements[1]. The Jharkhand Academic Council (JAC) also follows JCERT and NCERT textbooks for its curriculum[5].\n\nYou can find direct links to download JCERT books in PDF format for classes 1 through 8 on various educational websites[1]. For example, Class 1 books for all subjects are available in both English and Hindi medium[3][4]. These typically include subjects like Math-Magic (Maths) and Rain-drops[4]. Some resources also provide an overview of chapters for specific textbooks, such as the Class 5 English textbook \"Sunshine,\" which includes chapters like \"Good Night and Good Morning,\" \"A Blind Child Speaks,\" and \"My Nation\"[6].\n\nAdditionally, there are mobile applications like \"Jharkhand School Books 2026\" that allow you to download and read these textbooks, along with providing guides and previous year\'s question papers[7].\n\nSources:\n[1] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHhRETgAkav0loIeNAwtitMX2DRwiLH5_mrhiZf5YadXvTplQIEVssyK_HQiLVuyLz_S7F7ROD_HZmOvFI93XE8V_jw3Wz-U1Nlv6IC_BN-u3gjSEOZJx34rcaVVjaVsOE9q2qRMZcCVsDfdQ==)\n[2] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHDIBuhnolZdAl67X5_9EoFvWedsbgjsgxS4jOe4bVpl51fT-OPFkAY1Ae5FWAo_wCw28njle6NpvezX206DX8xPh2YS2UTn_Jp8FADET5iZzC_h6BBm-4YMU2l34MWzcyWo7BErRv762b6mFzaIfKeZp4bu3PSvQ==)\n[3] [jacboardsolut