    summary: "The Jharkhand Council of Educational Research and Training (JCERT) prescribes textbooks for primary classes in Jharkhand, often aligning with NCERT (National Council of Educational Research and Training) curriculum. The textbooks are available in both Hindi and English mediums.\n\nHere are some of the common textbook names for Class 1, Class 2, and Class 3 in Jharkhand:\n\n**Class 1**\n*   **Mathematics:** \"Math-Magic\" (English Medium) and \"\340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\246\340\245\202\" (Hindi Medium)[1][2].\n*   **English:** \"Marigold\" and \"Raindrops\"[1].\n*   **Hindi:** \"\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\256\340\244\235\340\244\277\340\244\256\"[1].\n\n**Class 2**\n*   **Mathematics:** \"Math-Magic\" (English Medium) and \"\340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\246\340\245\202\" (Hindi Medium)[3][4].\n*   **English:** \"Marigold,\" \"Raindrops,\" and \"My Voice\"[3][4][5][6].\n*   **Hindi:** \"\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\256\340\244\235\340\244\277\340\244\256\"[3][4].\n*   **Environmental Studies (EVS):** EVS textbooks are also available for Class 2[3].\n\n**Class 3**\n*   **Mathematics:** \"Math-Magic\" (English Medium) and \"\340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\246\340\245\202\" (Hindi Medium)[3][7][8].\n*   **English:** \"Marigold\" and \"Sunshine\"[3][9].\n*   **Hindi:** \"\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\256\340\244\235\340\244\277\340\244\256\" and \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277\"[3][8].\n*   **Environmental Studies (EVS):** \"Looking Around\" (English Medium) and \"\340\244\206\340\244\270-\340\244\252\340\244\276\340\244\270\" (Hindi Medium)[3][8].\n\nSources:\n[1] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEofds5E_ez3jeuup-bRAoyOU-VgbyCXdXcgKP6zOgtEVvHG8XP9It2k_3rY1kC6OC7qFuVh9CJg5Q-rrfhLIdHPQ_XBAb2n5k5fPWTY0-Dv9bh0W2EnA3-zmz7nL5dOdjN81zkyvKKQQ5bpybZvF0qt9y0_Q==)\n[2] [byjus.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF1RnTlUsoChW3ZfrSbn-37pkjmscQQbkw6H77Hz5KGQzOJFcFFE62WNd7fvyL4Zb1fNbksBJgIBa11Sc-B61rOpNxi6AfB-SaDecK1O_5bk39eLsbaQNkOqE-I5SdvAg==)\n[3] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFX6eTX_WJ3Abi9N8kKUdxdRj7Fpf8m0-QuwPx7aMmZfiMmsu3rLQcBxXGaeWUbyoLdGX4mLoSkHXeCf-hjckKHiSKuiqpw6-pOlNV5z-upHhZxgjPEsxIoX8orCtb3Dmwyg9fm8Lh9FYucX4VbbX0z)\n[4] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE-kBVCGDuclOJNbEA2CoJf5amKNK74ystAloUe6a_bG3OK0NFKvkCPehFS4fWNS-Axyv2DW3TiaLLhQPl2geJBYgM4HXHfPV_h2QYuKBCh98vZMg5pMyaYnXvs7lYQkDjWmrqIBL0KivI3waox8NMeIsOZyQ==)\n[5] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHMwbAGyNjUoXdfNTjYM7E-4pv8b78Xhtqt5enWKiOgZbT5TuoiKDo2WnV5Gd-Ei8ANaUpEXbWTXe5V8agBDITfGxc9wQ2YdjE3Ss0q60gKsvbnlMMcdS2sdKX53kh-yJ7AtQQuyCM=)\n[6] [byjus.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFB2RF9i81sLSy3pLT1KdrhczbVfZGAvvjy_ptaIPRkj_bia2Eg8A6XwItkN6HGBD1ljCA-dyPfOApV8rVCoDxLxw1gdLSTYjklKrFWnPj_LEkjWAsUn8VLCvpJLA5Q4g==)\n[7] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG7YBAAXlqMqxPmdVI3ynL8hSAx7Aw0rRNArJOPBj2e_XNo_k6ZP0MA-3O43fmkgc7DrVm-CINhEPORkueGC9lM5mCSbhcfSlZdcpolB6EngkhoO1iTdfd9mcCXsCbMTcPMm1R8a9HADxziB2Xk8LgFb6Q8bmkI2EUxXnyuIM5a5b23nfYwbv4VVX7E6w==)\n[8] [jacboardsolutions.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGRwgYQDs4plo9l5FTkhNjHOiQix3sOc-yrFwDyMERLqIwQRgE-EbFREUa0xIBMzT8uosniXxz1zPHSUhBBVkQaC_E_AfRM6cUGb_I8EQrXIx6J3YvHdA51apGOgeA1h2Uc8tq2DEQBoJxhCpxZ7g-2Xip-PXrRvvWlThk=)\n[9] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGUiEWt1at7TTB0O4qV-R9l9C2Hv4aHpccDYtIr7r037a