    summary: "I couldn\'t find a direct list of chapter names for a \"JCERT textbook class 1 Hindi Bhashanjali\".\n\nBased on the search, the Jharkhand Academic Council (JAC), which operates under JCERT, provides Hindi textbooks for Class 1 primarily named \"\340\244\235\340\244\277\340\244\262\340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\262 - I\", \"\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\244\260 -1\", and \"\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\244\260-2\"[1]. While a \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 (\340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200)\" textbook for Class 3 from JCERT was found with its chapter list, a Class 1 version with that title and its specific chapter names could not be identified through the search queries[2].\n\nIt is possible that \"Bhashanjali\" is an older edition of a JCERT Class 1 Hindi textbook, or it may not be a widely used or currently available textbook under that specific title for Class 1. Many search results for Class 1 Hindi textbooks refer to NCERT books like \"Rimjhim\" and \"Sarangi\", which are different publications[3][4][5][6].\n\nSources:\n[1] [jacportal.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEbee2_Z9lhlmgJTIPCo50uC5-rV9VPdDuVk2gfCSldkrvp9HER8gx6FOF1icnVYYhMGvkm3HWacK9DgRVIy4pCx6UAVAswQslK2oTDM98JIOnzxqeyXJ50owjYln51VQ==)\n[2] [scribd.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF8qT8DBuEGRZzf2H2iBMsv2klt2BYce9gp8BDmfxgvMcrqTya4sTF4-z19spHkYTatIs8gR2_00QIgFWSDIOPzckQe2LwDHTGbC6evpwZwyyDT35kgK9TV5X3EyyLOoN7IQYFOASNTpky16eGis2oaX-WTeShiVhoFyfs-_6EPRPZi1tVqQFwchYur9A==)\n[3] [byjus.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEPHQ5crV1JthFdTb9E7FnyHoXKGK0hJK9FYaDxHyTyF7QOp-9kYQKUgw44JYshPf8-kfFbzvGB-7X8xiF4IPxejH4h6HSdK6gttN1OzK9wOcNv-COR-18_q8WSBdkJTUzkI3Bylujz8zU2bg==)\n[4] [vedantu.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding