    summary: "I was unable to find JCERT textbooks for classes 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5 directly on jacportal.com using the `site:` operator. However, several other reputable sources provide these textbooks for download.\n\nJCERT (Jharkhand Council of Educational Research and Training) textbooks for classes 1 to 5 are available in PDF format, often in both Hindi and English mediums. These textbooks are considered the primary source of information for students of the Jharkhand board[1][2][3][4][5][6].\n\nHere\'s a breakdown of what was found regarding JCERT textbooks for these classes:\n*   **Class 1:** Textbooks are available in PDF format in both Hindi and English mediums[5]. English textbooks like \"Sunrise - 1\" cover topics such as \"Myself,\" \"My Daily Routine,\" and \"My Family\"[7].\n*   **Class 2:** Textbooks are available in PDF format in both Hindi and English mediums[2]. The English textbook \"Sunrise - 2\" includes units on \"Myself,\" \"My Daily Routine,\" and \"My Friends\"[8].\n*   **Class 3:** Textbooks are available in PDF format in both Hindi and English mediums[4]. The English textbook \"Sunshine\" covers chapters like \"My Dear One\" and \"Androcles and the Lion\"[9][10][11].\n*   **Class 4:** Textbooks are available in PDF format in both Hindi and English mediums[1]. The English textbook \"Sunshine\" includes units such as \"The Stars,\" \"Frogs at School,\" and \"Sun\'s Family\"[12][13].\n*   **Class 5:** Textbooks are available in PDF format in both Hindi and English mediums[3]. The English textbook \"Sunshine\" features units on \"Good Night and Good Morning,\" \"A Blind Child Speaks,\" and \"Save the World\"[14][15][16].\n\nWhile jacportal.com did not yield direct results in this search, websites like Net Explanations offer direct download links for these JCERT textbooks[1][2][3][4][5][6]. Additionally, some YouTube channels provide explanations and exercises related to specific chapters from these textbooks[12][10][17][18][11][15][16][19]. Some resources also mention that these textbooks are intended for free distribution[20][21].\n\nSources:\n[1] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF6_aDMj9E4e-_jVNZJzzbB1TkI4SJs5XQgJChiQ4ZaJzk-KhA_ZWIDhxnrG-H_TYVGRwRspBHkPdzwUzHkXD9firJqM78B3vlqtVHoHR37-eRR595nTygM514zBCX3QebiNPj_DP4jWINN5QKGpgfo2pU=)\n[2] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFnln-DoiejuYOnK2kgstowOdZD8Al8K7oXkcKeowv_vLPV75myVFMu20zaAjaCAM61okisVbtJqu1vPqJSIsWUxtOyXF-1X6ErGisPqnHF6gpK3jsCSbzutoOb3gAWqS38MSCcgXTENjV02udjhg81A8c=)\n[3] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQETG113CzFcUs0waCL47IQJxBr__hgtZu9JtxsiFKyQiojZiY1FtOXw3pszY8nfECelR7-e35zWRVwLiOPtTZYmzCHfzlapSePcMh0jFbaoaZEBVEFr4TN_9W_e_xqktZiymlyuzenqfCuptjGOSTI0WMs=)\n[4] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQElmpb6p_t0ipWnpa_nORh22twukDeux_B_ghj-KEp5H_brTlVotQPjMSuMDTziZB5TdLEbkpukuJh2j_xfO3k9wVgFqHMAA5dkKuVa-kpb--GFNgJtdTrdb9W9qFRmdjiGECfuVK_ja9bj7t7tbrZNTik=)\n[5] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFCKwhZyz4c8HClYnisF9-x38eQqmL9gLeMlD1FcKd1GiN1ZWm0uSPp4CWBsiW6u8cbEzDOX7ufk-bxcrU3jBvfZR3HgDqEpall4_cRHUHa7N7re1w9VLLoK9OE5mFOnfbjN67dc4V7sc1j7aP8Y3CHwwY=)\n[6] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGrrEZDhyTLCk0l2oCSG0a2KXnAcMdAZfuIDK1DRWu8ARay0jn5m_ywxj39W3Ss63zx1QWjzgCoaINO-tSKCHK_lo50vIf7oQjRm4kv1iC7n7m-T-5FbGWRW2-02gdefG0nWenjyEmhBFyDjg==)\n[7] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEDpTYEd3XiRbpKPx1djRxjBuY10dGMvNHN1MO8VmMcLp5eC-Z7mYfYxnV6tyLkY81K4f9iPsK5AD7q2SZSYYK-5JmWkCfyjuwopmTsI-rki1J8SCN3on5F1ab7Xl7aj5HpD_P5zKUBE4YkWU-1Kn9jBUQa5mnRAYNOm2t49IQEoh8=)\n[8] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEStc56JjsCozoI0SDLOysPLdNti4uT-abiLUIk9by