  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Expanding the Curriculum**\n\nI\'ve successfully executed all eight unit tests in 221ms! Now, my focus shifts to enriching `src/data/curriculum.ts`. My intention is to precisely replicate the official JCERT Jharkhand textbook chapters for Classes 1 through 5, ensuring 100% adherence to the government-issued books and syllabus. I am currently cross-referencing to ensure accuracy.\n\n\n**Detailing Textbook Content**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics for Class 1. I am meticulously extracting chapter details from the JCERT Jharkhand textbooks. \"\340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\246\340\245\202\" has chapter 1 completed, and I\'m currently working on Chapters 2-13, listing each chapter and its focus. I intend to mirror the official content precisely. Next up, I\'ll be working on \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 1\" (Hindi).\n\n\n**Cataloging Book Chapters**\n\nI\'ve moved on to meticulously cataloging \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 1\" (Hindi) for Class 1. I am now precisely listing out the chapters and their subjects, specifically chapters 1 through 10. The English content for \"Sunrise - 1 (JCERT Class 1)\" is also mapped out. I\'m noting the integration of environmental studies within the \"\340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\260\340\245\200 \340\244\254\340\244\227\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276\" and \"\340\244\206\340\244\225\340\245\203\340\244\244\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\201 \340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\245\340\244\276\340\244\250\" sections and will add a banner with an explanation.\n\n\n**Mapping Class 2 Data**\n\nI\'m now cataloging the Class 2 curriculum. I am carefully transcribing chapter details from the \"\340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\246\340\245\202 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 2\" textbook for Mathematics. I\'ve finished listing the chapters, including titles such as \"\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\244\276 \340\244\271\340\245\210 \340\244\262\340\244\202\340\244\254\340\244\276, \340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\244\276 \340\244\271\340\245\210 \340\244\227\340\245\213\340\244\262?\" and \"\340\244\227\340\244\277\340\244\250\340\245\213 \340\244\256\340\244\227\340\244\260 \340\244\270\340\244\256\340\245\202\340\244\271\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\202\". I\'m also starting the Hindi content from \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 2\" with \"\340\244\212\340\244\201\340\244\237 \340\244\232\340\244\262\340\244\276\" and \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\262\340\245\202 \340\244\250\340\245\207 \340\244\226\340\245\207\340\244\262\340\245\200 \340\244\253\340\245\201\340\244\237\340\244\254\340\245\211\340\244\262\" to record chapter details.\n\n\n**Compiling Class 2 Lessons**\n\nI\'m currently focused on Class 2, specifically cataloging the Hindi and English content. I\'ve completed chapter listings for \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 2\" including \"\340\244\205\340\244\247\340\244\277\340\244\225 \340\244\254\340\244\262\340\244\265\340\244\276\340\244\250 \340\244\225\340\245\214\340\244\250?\" and \"\340\244\246\340\245\213\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\244 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\256\340\244\246\340\244\246\". I\'m also capturing the English chapters of \"Sunrise - 2\" from \"Myself and My Home\" to \"Good Habits.\"\n\n\n**Listing Class 3 Chapters**\n\nI\'m now detailing the Class 3 curriculum. For \"\340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\246\340\245\202 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 3\", I\'ve cataloged chapters 6 through 9, including \"\340\244\262\340\245\207\340\244\250\340\245\207 \340\244\246\340\245\207\340\244\250\340\245\207 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\226\340\245\207\340\244\262\" and \"\340\244\254\340\245\213\340\244\262\340\245\213 \340\244\255\340\244\210 \340\244\225\340\244\277\340\244\244\340\244\250\340\245\207 \340\244\227\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\276?\". I am transcribing the chapters for \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 3\", which include titles like \"\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\262\340\244\227\340\244\276\340\244\241\340\244\274\340\245\200\" and \"\340\244\225\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\245\202\340\244\270\". I\'m listing each chapter of \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 3\" exactly as found in the official textbooks.\n\n\n**Cataloging Class 3 Content**\n\nI am now documenting the Class 3 material. I\'ve finished the Hindi and English content. I\'ve compiled chapter details for \"Sunshine - 3 (JCERT Class 3)\", including chapters like \"My Dear One\" to \"The Brave Tailor\". I\'ve also listed the chapters for EVS in \"\340\244\271\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\276 \340\244\252\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\265\340\245\207\340\244\266 - 3 (JCERT \340\244\206\340\244\270-\340\244\252\340\244\276\340\244\270 Class 3)\" from \"\340\244\252\340\245\202\340\244\250\340\244\256 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\246\340\244\277\340\244\250\340\244\232\340\244\260\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\244\276\" to \"\340\244\252\340\244\202\340\244\226 \340\244\253\340\245\210\340\244\262\340\244\276\340\244\217\340\244\201, \340\244\211\340\244\241\340\244\274\340\244\244\340\245\207 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\217\340\244\201\". The listing is complete and accurate.\n\n\n**Transcribing Class 4 Data**\n\nI\'m presently focused on Class 4, cataloging both Mathematics and Hindi chapters from the JCERT textbooks. I have just finished listing the chapters for \"\340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\246\340\245\202 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 4,\" including \"\340\244\210\340\244\202\340\244\237\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\270\340\245\207 \340\244\254\340\244\250\340\245\200 \340\244\207\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\244\" and \"\340\244\227\340\244\276\340\245\234\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\201 \340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\252\340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\217.\" I\'m now proceeding with \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 4\", which includes \"\340\244\225\340\245\213\340\244\257\340\244\262\" and \"\340\244\246\340\244\276\340\244\246\340\245\200 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\270\340\244\276\340\244\241\340\244\274\340\245\200\".\n\n\n**Detailing Class 4 Content**\n\nI\'m cataloging the Class 4 material, specifically the chapters for \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 4\", \"Sunshine - 4\" and \"\340\244\271\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\276 \340\244\252\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\265\340\245\207\340\244\266 - 4.\" I have now completed transcribing the chapter titles for Hindi, including titles like \"\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\245\213\340\244\202\" and \"\340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\265\340\244\244\340\244\202\340\244\244\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\244\340\244\276 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\223\340\244\260.\" I\'ve also listed the English chapters, from \"The Stars\" to \"The Ant and the Dove.\" Finally, I\'m documenting the EVS chapters, which include \"\340\244\232\340\244\262\340\245\213 \340\244\232\340\244\262\340\245\207\340\244\202 \340\244\270\340\245\215\340\244\225\340\245\202\340\244\262\" and \"\340\244\205\340\244\256\340\245\203\340\244\244\340\244\276 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\225\340\244\271\340\244\276\340\244\250\340\245\200.\"\n\n\n\n**Listing Class 5 Details**\n\nI am now focusing on the Class 5 curriculum. For EVS, \"\340\244\271\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\276 \340\244\252\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\265\340\245\207\340\244\266 - 5 (JCERT \340\244\206\340\244\270-\340\244\252\340\244\276\340\244\270 Class 5)\", I\'ve detailed chapters 5 through 8, including \"\340\244\205\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\244\340\244\276 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\256\340\244\247\340\245\201\340\244\256\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\226\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\201\" (Anita and the Honeybees) and \"\340\244\250\340\244\276\340\244\250\340\245\200 \340\244\225\340\245\207 \340\244\230\340\244\260 \340\244\244\340\244\225\" (Reaching Grandmother\'s House). I\'ve moved to \"\340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\246\340\245\202 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 5 (JCERT Class 5)\" and completed chapter listings from \"\340\244\256\340\244\233\340\244\262\340\245\200 \340\244\211\340\244\233\340\244\262\340\245\200\" (The Fish Tale) through \"\340\244\250\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\266\340\244\276\" (Mapping Your Way).\n\n\n**Mapping Class 5 Content**\n\nI\'ve completed cataloging the Class 5 Hindi and English chapters. For \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227 5\", I\'ve meticulously listed all chapters, from \"\340\244\271\340\244\256 \340\244\270\340\244\254 \340\244\270\340\245\201\340\244\256\340\244\250 \340\244\217\340\244\225 \340\244\211\340\244\252\340\244\265\340\244\250 \340\244\225\340\245\207\" to \"\340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\260\340\245\207 \340\244\252\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\245\340\244\256 \340\244\266\340\244\277\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\267\340\244\225\". \"Sunshine - 5\" is also fully mapped, containing chapters from \"Good Night and Good Morning\" to \"The Flying Kite\". The data transcription is accurate.\n\n\n**Expanding Class 5 Data**\n\nI\'ve just finished documenting \"\340\244\271\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\244\276 \340\244\252\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\265\340\245\207\340\244\266 - 5\", the EVS textbook, including chapters on \"\340\244\270\340\245\201\340\244\252\340\244\260 \340\244\270\340\245\207\340\244\202\340\244\270\340\245\207\340\244\234\" (Super Senses) and \"\340\244\252\340\244\276\340\244\250\340\245\200 \340\244\225\340\245\207 \340\244\252\340\245\215\340\244\260\340\244\257\340\245\213\340\244\227\" (Experiments with Water). I am also adding the exact textbook names to the subject selector component for Classes 1 and 2, which are \"\340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\234\340\244\276\340\244\246\340\245\202\" and \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277\".\n\n\n**Defining Curriculum Structure**\n\nI\'m now integrating the overall curriculum structure within the teacher portal. I am adding a \"Curriculum & PDF Manager\" tab. Within this section, I will add an \"Upload / Paste Curriculum JSON\" option, allowing for the JSON file upload of chapter lists, along with PDF links and translations. There will also be a modal to \"Add New Chapter\" and a download for the JSON Template.\n\n\n"
