  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "{\"step_index\":1,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:25:28Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nPROJECT: \\\"Bhasha Setu\\\" \342\200\223 an animated, mother-tongue learning app for tribal children in Jharkhand primary schools (Class 1 to 5), supporting SDG 4: Quality Education.\\n\\nLANGUAGES (ALL THREE REQUIRED)\\n1. Santali \342\200\223 Ol Chiki script (Unicode), with Roman transliteration.\\n2. Ho \342\200\223 Warang Chiti script (Unicode), with Devanagari and Roman transliteration, since many Ho speakers write in Devanagari.\\n3. Mundari \342\200\223 default Devanagari, with Roman and Mundari Bani as optional scripts.\\n- The child pi\\n<truncated 7108 bytes>\\n curriculum data file with its schema, a README explaining how to add chapters, audio, games and languages, and a short guide for teachers.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-20T06:25:28-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-a3x67buu7bx6d7p6vwrc2v-981092066620.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-a3x67buu7bx6d7p6vwrc2v-981092066620.asia-southeast1.run.app\\nUser Email: apekshagowda56@gmail.com\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":2,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:25:28Z\",\"input_tokens\":22505,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":277,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Request**\\n\\nI\'m deep-diving into the user request, focusing on \\\"Bhasha Setu,\\\" the animated learning app for tribal children in Jharkhand. My primary focus is on how it aligns with SDG 4: Quality Education, with a Class 1-5 focus.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/skills/system_skills/ultra_mode/SKILL.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Reading Ultra Mode skill\\\"\",\"toolSummary\