gs\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WelcomeScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"58\",\"StartLine\":\"50\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing lines 50 to 58\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View WelcomeScreen lines 50-58\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":125,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:41:43Z\",\"input_tokens\":2634,\"cache_read_tokens\":168091,\"output_tokens\":172,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Update speech transliteration\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"56\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Change transliteration on line 54\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"            speechTransliteration=\\\\\\\"\341\261\237\341\261\242\341\261\237\341\261\234 \341\261\257\341\261\237\341\261\271\341\261\250\341\261\245\341\261\244 \341\261\265\341\261\237\341\261\252\341\261\267\341\261\237\341\261\243 \341\261\242\341\261\256! \342\200\242 \340\244\205\340\244\252\340\244\250\340\245\200 \340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\244\340\245\203\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276 \340\244\232\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\245\213!\\\\\\\"\\\"\",\"StartLine\":\"53\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"            speechTransliteration=\\\\\\\"Which is your mother tongue? \340\250\206\340\250\252\340\250\243\340\251\200 \340\250\256\340\250\276\340\250\244\340\250\255\341\261\237\340\250\270\340\250\274\340\250\276 / \340\244\205\340\244\252\340\244\250\340\245\200 \340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\244\340\245\203\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276 \340\244\232\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\245\213!\\\\\\\"\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/WelcomeScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Replacing line 54\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update speech transliteration\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":127,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:41:46Z\",\"input_tokens\":2432,\"cache_read_tokens\":168580,\"output_tokens\":2518,\"thinking\":\"**Refactoring WelcomeScreen.tsx**\\n\\nOkay, I\'ve had a breakthrough! I realized that `write_to_file` with `Overwrite: true` is ideal for `WelcomeScreen.tsx` because it can handle non-ASCII characters without any encoding issues. I\'m going to rewrite that particular file using this approach.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { Volume2, Play, Sparkles } from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport { LanguageId } from \'../types\';\\\\nimport { LANGUAGES, ACTIVE_LANGUAGES } from \'../data/languages\';\\\\nimport { Mascot } from \'./Mascot\';\\\\nimport { sound\\n<truncated 8353 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Update WelcomeScreen with refined font classes and clean typography\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/WelcomeScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating WelcomeScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update WelcomeScreen typography\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":129,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:42:02Z\",\"input_tokens\":2738,\"cache_read_tokens\":170976,\"output_tokens\":58,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Compile applet after font updates\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":131,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:42:14Z\",\"input_tokens\":2280,\"cache_read_tokens\":171574,\"output_tokens\":35,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"restart_dev_server\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Restarting dev server\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Restart development server\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":133,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:42:17Z\",\"input_tokens\":2253,\"cache_read_tokens\":171715,\"output_tokens\":343,\"thinking\":\"**Initiating Browser Verification**\\n\\nI\'m now initiating browser verification for three scenarios. First, the desktop welcome screen at 1440x900. Secondly, I\'m testing on a mobile phone screen at 390x844, adhering to the \\\"small Android phone\\\" request. Lastly, I\'ll be verifying the \\\"Pick Santali or Ho\\\" journey, proceeding to the Class Selector.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\\\nmkdir -p .playwright-cli\\\\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000\\\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900\\\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/r2-welcome-desktop.png\\\\nplaywright-cli resize 39\\n<truncated 109 bytes>\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\".\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"8000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Testing welcome screen responsive views\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Capture desktop and mobile welcome screen\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":135,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:42:29Z\",\"input_tokens\":2836,\"cache_read_tokens\":173950,\"output_tokens\":71,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/.playwright-cli/r2-welcome-mobile.png\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing mobile welcome screenshot\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View mobile welcome screenshot\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":137,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:42:37Z\",\"input_tokens\":3419,\"cache_read_tokens\":174602,\"output_tokens\":1924,\"thinking\":\"**Observing Renderings**\\n\\nI\'ve noted the Ol Chiki and Warang Chiti scripts rendering as expected in the mobile screenshot. The Devanagari script is also correctly displayed. I\'m pleased with the accuracy of these initial renderings, especially for less common scripts.\\n\\n\\n**Addressing Font Deficiencies**\\n\\nI\'ve pinpointed a crucial design oversight. The lack of specific font declarations for Ol Chiki and Warang Chiti within the speech bubble and pills led to box characters in the rendering, showing that the default font couldn\'t display these glyphs. This is a critical insight. To solve this, I\'m proposing a comprehensive CSS solution, including a layer base. It utilizes a custom `--font-cartoon` variable to specify a font stack that includes `Noto Sans Ol Chiki`, `Noto Sans Warang Chiti`, and other appropriate fonts.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"@import \\\\\\\"tailwindcss\\\\\\\";\\\\n\\\\n@font-face {\\\\n  font-family: \'Noto Sans Warang Chiti\';\\\\n  src: url(\'/fonts/NotoSansWarangCiti-Regular.ttf\') format(\'truetype\');\\\\n  font-weight: 100 900;\\\\n  font-style: normal;\\\\n  font-display: swap;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\n@font-face {\\\\n  font-f\\n<truncated 3262 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Include tribal fonts in global font fallback chain so glyphs never render as boxes\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/index.css\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating index.css font stack\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update global font stack with tribal fallbacks\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":139,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:42:55Z\",\"input_tokens\":4242,\"cache_read_tokens\":175994,\"output_tokens\":47,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Compile applet with updated font fallback\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":141,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:43:00Z\",\"input_tokens\":2268,\"cache_read_tokens\":178097,\"output_tokens\":38,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"restart_dev_server\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Restarting dev server\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Restart development server\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":143,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:43:03Z\",\"input_tokens\":2256,\"cache_read_tokens\":178226,\"output_tokens\":402,\"thinking\":\"**Executing User Journey**\\n\\nI\'ve outlined the full user journey. First, the welcome screen, followed by language selection \342\200\223 Santali or Ho. Then, class selection (Class 1), followed by subject (Mathematics), and specific chapter (Shapes & Space - Benchmark). I will then verify the lesson view, and finally, play the games.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\\\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000\\\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900\\\\n# Step 1: Pick Santali\\\\nplaywright-cli find \\\\\\\"Choose Santali\\\\\\\"\\\\nplaywright-cli click \\\\\\\"Choose Santali\\\\\\\"\\\\nsleep 1\\\\nplaywright-cl\\n<truncated 409 bytes>\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\".\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Testing user journey navigation\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run journey from Welcome -> Classes -> Subjects -> Chapters\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":145,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:43:17Z\",\"input_tokens\":2862,\"cache_read_tokens\":178394,\"output_tokens\":911,\"content\":\"An asynchronous task has finished.\\nTask id: f7a91744-aabe-438b-8fbd-f4791e9ad47b/task-144\\nTask description: trap \'playwright-cli close\' EXIT\\nplaywright-cli open --browser=chromium http://localhost:3000\\nplaywright-cli resize 1440 900\\n# Step 1: Pick Santali\\nplaywright-cli find \\\"Choose Santali\\\"\\nplaywright-cli click \\\"Choose Santali\\\"\\nsleep 1\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --filename=.playwright-cli/j1-classes.png\\n# Step 2: Pick Class 1\\nplaywright-cli find \\\"Class 1\\\"\\nplayw