ze 1440 900\\\\n# 1. Click Santali Card\\\\nplaywright-cli click \'button[aria-label=\\\\\\\"Select Santali language\\\\\\\"]\'\\\\nplaywright-cli screenshot --fil\\n<truncated 682 bytes>\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\".\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"10000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Running complete user journey navigation\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Walk through entire learning journey from Class to Lesson to Games\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":150,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:43:50Z\",\"input_tokens\":4643,\"cache_read_tokens\":181211,\"output_tokens\":364,\"thinking\":\"**Investigating CLI Snapshot**\\n\\nI\'m currently looking into the `playwright-cli open` and `playwright-cli snapshot` commands. I need to figure out why the element refs snapshot isn\'t quite working as expected. I\'m going to run the snapshot command first, or maybe use `?autostart=1`. Alternatively, I should maybe investigate the `WelcomeScreen.tsx` file for a possible clue.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WelcomeScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"85\",\"StartLine\":\"55\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing card definition in WelcomeScreen\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View WelcomeScreen card markup\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":152,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:43:59Z\",\"input_tokens\":3330,\"cache_read_tokens\":183769,\"output_tokens\":97,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WelcomeScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"155\",\"StartLine\":\"86\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing lines 86 to 155 of WelcomeScreen\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View WelcomeScreen lines\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":154,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:44:06Z\",\"input_tokens\":3601,\"cache_read_tokens\":184915,\"output_tokens\":214,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing UI Element Nesting**\\n\\nI\'ve observed a potential HTML nesting issue within `WelcomeScreen.tsx`. The card is currently a `div` that wraps a `button`. I realized this is incorrect, as you can\'t nest buttons. However, the \\\"Choose Santali\\\" action is correctly implemented as a standalone button. I\'m exploring how to properly structure the card component to avoid invalid HTML nesting while still achieving the desired visual and interactive outcome.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ChapterMap.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"90\",\"StartLine\":\"50\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing ChapterMap card definition\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View ChapterMap cards\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":156,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:44:18Z\",\"input_tokens\":3343,\"cache_read_tokens\":186436,\"output_tokens\":192,\"thinking\":\"**Refining Accessibility**\\n\\nI\'ve been working on improving the accessibility of the chapter cards in `ChapterMap.tsx`. I\'ve made the card a native HTML `<button>` element, which is the best practice. I\'ve added the `aria-label` attribute using the `chapter` data to provide a good, descriptive label for screen readers. Now, the screen readers will know that these elements are buttons that open specific chapters.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ChapterMap.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"158\",\"StartLine\":\"130\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing end of ChapterMap\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View ChapterMap card closing tag\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":158,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:44:23Z\",\"input_tokens\":3038,\"cache_read_tokens\":187705,\"output_tokens\":530,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Change ChapterMap card to semantic button element\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"80\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Replace div with button\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"            <button\\\\n              key={chapter.id}\\\\n              onClick={() => handleChapterClick(chapter)}\\\\n              className={`w-full text-left relative rounded-3xl p-5 border-4 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer shadow-lg press-bounce \\n<truncated 471 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"65\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"            <div\\\\n              key={chapter.id}\\\\n              onClick={() => handleChapterClick(chapter)}\\\\n              className={`relative rounded-3xl p-5 border-4 transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer shadow-lg press-bounce group ${\\\\n          \\n<truncated 510 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/ChapterMap.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating ChapterMap card to button\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Make ChapterMap card semantic button\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":160,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:44:28Z\",\"input_tokens\":3210,\"cache_read_tokens\":188572,\"output_tokens\":152,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Change closing div to closing button in ChapterMap\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"154\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Replace closing div with closing button\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"                </div>\\\\n              </div>\\\\n            </button>\\\"\",\"StartLine\":\"148\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"                </div>\\\\n              </div>\\\\n            </div>\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/ChapterMap.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating ChapterMap closing tag\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Close ChapterMap button\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":162,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:44:32Z\",\"input_tokens\":2527,\"cache_read_tokens\":189635,\"output_tokens\":141,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WelcomeScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"165\",\"StartLine\":\"145\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing WelcomeScreen action button markup\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View WelcomeScreen action button lines\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":164,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:44:42Z\",\"input_tokens\":8522,\"cache_read_tokens\":184270,\"output_tokens\":311,\"thinking\":\"**Revising Code Elements**\\n\\nI\'ve replaced the `div` element on line 150 with a `<button>` tag. This improves accessibility and semantic correctness, and ensures the correct function of the element. I\'ve also updated the `type` to \\\"button\\\", and `aria-label` attribute. I believe this refactoring will make the UI more user friendly.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/WelcomeScreen.tsx\\\"\",\"ContentOffset\":\"0\",\"EndLine\":\"95\",\"StartLine\":\"75\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing WelcomeScreen card container\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View card container in WelcomeScreen\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":166,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-20T13:44:50Z\",\"input_tokens\":3708,\"cache_read_tokens\":190045,\"output_tokens\":2478,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useState } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { Volume2, Play, Sparkles } from \'lucide-react\';\\\\nimport { LanguageId } from \'../types\';\\\\nimport { LANGUAGES, ACTIVE_LANGUAGES } from \'../data/languages\';\\\\nimport { Mascot } from \'./Mascot\';\\\\nimport { sound\\n<truncated 836