    summary: "JCERT textbooks for Class 1, 2, 3, 4, and 5 are available online, often in PDF format, for students studying under the Jharkhand Board. While direct links on `jcert.jharkhand.gov.in` were not prominently featured in the search, various educational websites provide these textbooks.\n\nKey findings include:\n*   **Availability across classes:** Textbooks for Class 1[1][2][3][4], Class 2[5][6][7][8], Class 3[9][10], Class 4[11][12][13], and Class 5[14][15][16][17] are accessible.\n*   **Subjects Covered:** These textbooks typically cover core subjects such as Hindi, English, Mathematics, and Environmental Studies (EVS)[9][11][7][15][3][16][10][13][17].\n*   **Medium of Instruction:** The textbooks are often available in both Hindi and English mediums[9][6][11][7][15][3][16][10][13][17].\n*   **Publishing Body:** The Jharkhand Council of Educational Research and Training (JCERT) publishes these books, which are designed to align with the state\'s curriculum and promote student development and curiosity[9][11][15][18].\n*   **Accessibility:** Many websites offer direct download links for these textbooks in PDF format to aid students, teachers, and parents[9][11][15][8][18][10].\n\nSources:\n[1] [jacboardsolutions.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF4AERRPg1MWPn2ZISF56cOVznRg6Qf_e3ZUojz0wkFnmZI2-LyzRyqeb9RmrhiltT4EHIJa_kioY7ZxLRbJQd1aHsdD6GTq9kM2T3OaPeA0H2NJi36lTx7reejr1MVUvC6S14H0Bk7hFHiU38f)\n[2] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHQHYl7bkFG9IcmaH3WKvWQEet29ooNEix6h88Z-_PEsPdSBQQHjCIltRAbztPvZrsD2PdHOn0f9cUEtJJBkaEsFFkyKwjmTJT1rP-1uU3FGCFwDxOf2IGGgI7hAN-n62G8tdIYIPgKyW8cnRLUW_vQDVI=)\n[3] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEF3fDffjvCZBR2yVy3K6CA4UyQuZISRRr29huUMhvDyW1lRJgpTwv_fUjoxd2dGc-IEqUh8TYW9O7-adN_M94UEvI8ZuJiOkXhh8cpy2ia2kKAQvl4eyV9ckS3MTQug8MbAA7yuYkK_5Z-Ar6GPUT8PSvHJQ==)\n[4] [byjus.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHxaUPMir5y1h0NvUFxxPb9u45Q-bHwD3Mbzx35R_0LMMvZpp-pyGegtf4l80gPsd9p1UsU3Aq9JAQkyMiH1sqL2g39efk3HdDB5t3CDNBp6hoirxVTymWCzsOQq24mgg==)\n[5] [jacboardsolutions.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEuyz2KoQeTD4_BAgF65v50a7wdO93fODnT6ArcdKkj56yQ93D_3IrsQH7qFgCv5UDlgLxo70dBGXUnqhb-ygZH1EQDu_Vn7GXpvV_CPHfjFbGyyem7eVydCeiAak4vZqzcJJIOy6gB4QsI-rxC)\n[6] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE--k1YJdtzgkU5RgNW-oqnnmiwBXMrU1shbits2pkXjrhNs4wWJnOKMJCoR7dfxxXpEbIGrcngkkuOFz6Tt1SHNBK635m7iIRDtMgsC6z4A5AW5kxn49R-q0rTDfMaE5knbbvtRDvpRGuU2eACweKzevldNA==)\n[7] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH5LY_dLMo4txBSeVVnyTwoDzhJ1sLGBIO-nspLmKeX3dWXNRlGicYOiRysLvbQ_iB9DFG9BKyf90g_kHi_Syh6hptN8khvGbAeAk0CCiTvyMUsKiCWdkKYWwX9LelU6j1sHTCoEN8XXw8dpJw-xkHrZcs=)\n[8] [jacportal.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEePGjT2j6m0DJgyIxZY91Z7XzLRA03CpoWBzM802peESuUuX8X7HiCvGJccxITDdsSkRyxPd178j7oDYYMASm-QMUaJx7bVpkUFXVfew_5x_UDegc_Ad1Sk51NGy29BQ==)\n[9] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF8FSCiA6p8RyQzD4cIof81af3u1YbA0mbi0eCPsZWlcQoISnTFZjrR8kDu4pU10Ur3CmkU1zzdiCyUY7S-08o9tAwVjkJbn-1UvJbYaW7jIWfKoF2UIqS437Gw6eHhBJ5Fbioh_i6CpQgJ8FnyR4FhB4w=)\n[10] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFZRQ4F69K4BmozWNH4LxrbYQMuU_i06rwB0zJE8VWT0Wj-RdNGj-pxG77B0GSRG6MzMyAYQDxuvdFTb9qg-fTd9DsiMDsmI4KGBNCu4spnPLCw2qnfhzqvFxiJitdfKdfWIn5KYqqeMOfnBbUEh5JJqD-3yA==)\n[11] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHmfz-7jjtY0b0qOIiR6BNF0nPirB4VcVFVLbcid34KZOr1p1IW8HsazsJlKx4ZWcdZpPsDekzLpZfKdXteYW7GcZShdV79nfQX5FDiw6gSMbJZ-lA0ib_3YklFa3eunG2kOcFDkF7Jfp7Hs6jmMMjvvAo=)\n[12] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/A