    }
    summary: "Here are the textbook chapters for JCERT Class 1 in English, Hindi, and Maths:\n\n**English (Sunrise \342\200\223 1)**[1]:\n*   Chapter 0: I Know\n*   Chapter 1: Myself\n*   Chapter 2: My Daily Routine\n*   Chapter 3: My Friend\n*   Chapter 4: My Food\n*   Chapter 5: My House\n*   Chapter 6: My Village Market\n*   Chapter 7: My school\n*   Chapter 8: My Village\n*   Chapter 9: My Family\n*   Chapter 10: My Classroom\n*   Chapter 11: Now I Know\n\n**Hindi**\nThe JCERT Class 1 Hindi textbooks are based on the NCERT syllabus[2]. The NCERT Class 1 Hindi textbook, \"\340\244\260\340\244\277\340\244\256\340\244\235\340\244\277\340\244\256\" (Rimjhim), includes chapters such as[3][4]:\n*   \340\244\235\340\245\202\340\244\262\340\244\276\n*   \340\244\206\340\244\256 \340\244\225\340\245\200 \340\244\225\340\244\271\340\244\276\340\244\250\340\245\200\n*   \340\244\252\340\244\244\340\245\215\340\244\244\340\245\207 \340\244\271\340\245\200 \340\244\252\340\244\244\340\245\215\340\244\244\340\245\207\n*   \340\244\252\340\244\225\340\245\214\340\244\241\340\244\274\340\245\200\n*   \340\244\260\340\244\270\340\245\213\340\244\210\340\244\230\340\244\260\n*   \340\244\232\340\245\202\340\244\271\340\245\213! \340\244\256\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\212\340\244\201 \340\244\270\340\245\213 \340\244\260\340\244\271\340\245\200 \340\244\271\340\245\210\n*   \340\244\254\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\244\260 \340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\227\340\244\277\340\244\262\340\244\271\340\244\260\340\245\200\n*   \340\244\252\340\244\244\340\244\202\340\244\227\n*   \340\244\227\340\245\207\340\244\202\340\244\246-\340\244\254\340\244\262\340\245\215\340\244\262\340\244\276\n*   \340\244\254\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\244\260 \340\244\227\340\244\257\340\244\276 \340\244\226\340\245\207\340\244\244 \340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\202 \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\227\n*   \340\244\217\340\244\225 \340\244\254\340\245\201\340\244\242\340\244\274\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276\n*   \340\244\256\340\245\210\340\244\202 \340\244\255\340\245\200\n*   \340\244\262\340\244\276\340\244\262\340\245\202 \340\244\224\340\244\260 \340\244\252\340\245\200\340\244\262\340\245\202\n*   \340\244\232\340\244\225\340\244\210 \340\244\225\340\245\207 \340\244\232\340\244\225\340\244\246\340\245\201\340\244\256\n*   \340\244\233\340\245\213\340\244\237\340\245\200 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\225\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\262\n*   \340\244\232\340\244\276\340\244\260 \340\244\232\340\244\250\340\245\207\n*   \340\244\255\340\244\227\340\244\246\340\244\241\340\244\274\n*   \340\244\271\340\244\262\340\245\200\340\244\256 \340\244\232\340\244\262\340\244\276 \340\244\232\340\244\276\340\244\201\340\244\246 \340\244\252\340\244\260\n\n**Mathematics**\nThe JCERT Class 1 Mathematics textbooks are also based on the NCERT syllabus[2] and are designed to develop a deep understanding of the subject[5]. The NCERT Class 1 Maths book, often referred to as \"Math-Magic,\" is structured with engaging chapters that cover basic concepts like shapes, counting, money, and measurement[6][7]. Specific chapter names are generally aligned with foundational mathematical concepts for young learners.\n\nSources:\n[1] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEmQEx7BUNAg-Zlt-Htd4hw5ZKDj1nnUs5eifAoMYBIEwKp_NFOotmVgwHsm2bJxu8ZuO60wq6Y5FHxEoglSiZrjvSy-P8p8Zwvfmxe0S-7RNtVgdbhyZo9oejch9YZgEqeUKtPqyWcv5SNCu1zk3WzyJImR0HrjLq7yKLtKFeHDQ==)\n[2] [jharupdate.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHzzRnwEecOV-POaIvA89UCdw2x1OPUVNSjAuyPrcyFxuOz-s9JxtPNx2bkjHwYS55CtNvUWzkpyTysmMiERa60U8lrVQ7MlUnjiualsyqH63eTkFveXqYGvgKyLqoSuQxCKb3G5ZZ9eSSo0gt4GsrobLw08RdU)\n[3] [byjus.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEbHUkOEQYaSrl0tYGb8zJRWkSreSVqM5Ue4v3htoPB6xXwZOh5XQSAcWGf1vDUGpY9g8eAH7r4mXD_O9ORtyZ0uIjLGYeHV03aVJo760owBbbFW1XR-eLEbYhzIc95uwfq96DlrXB-pMRV)\n[4] [studiestoday.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHCSMq60VOA3Sn5QEvVEGd_wuinhOYF3LvQqPLpCeEJKxxgvbb_WEUG3gVzJT1kehPjQR7PJeVHa_TkAKMOuILrybro9T4d2uDnX3VQzzCdjl4wBqGmpwRPDONh8MnNxkpL1QdH9vd9_Pw215tVZBc13_-oeQ==)\n[5] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEjtMnjWBwDqoRt7uxfI99VcITLyyM6P9IiWcY1T7hjPEjy3e8-iyYBA2dXP2PyWnNYgIy0DpHB9a-yIK8Pi9iL7lcdOh52rnQuJHnn3uL1mrqaw1IycEeZ-oBNc3DLmWg3FEfEtwMXvR8bvTNHK-WXyQ==)\n[6] [oswaalbooks.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHDhIo7NMzgzeXF-BDZFwqgoZnIRMSYQEx8gcRNbergN8mgvfKf8AISnuBaPQLPcODi9ksWQ5T6UBlB9UlQ8lHzG2ZiGINHNcIdTdmCqi4ForSyBBvWtkaxPSOvlBku37d1FJFZw6uvMLeJNFlZ6aCFcqaQk-w5o4Ja3qeNDmSAhGmGhGuUsGLy5dIUINBNWqU3lTHF)\n[7] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEIIwRMWNQdSJhht7QFabhiaYCbnBl59zh0BSbsihKTnCyAiyZC5Vhd_sHSZosIQjo2IAimVzrjtpk5f6LF4Axd7dnuIV2v9ri7g7xN-DgQc_tFpZfiyLHgbsUVMLvCefY54EZD7yMFcQtOS9zNu9FPg4rZ)"
