    summary: "The `jacboardsolutions.com` website provides PDF downloads of JCERT (Jharkhand Council of Educational Research and Training) textbooks for classes 1 through 5, as well as for higher classes up to 12[1]. The site states that it offers direct links to these textbooks, which are published and circulated by JCERT[1].\n\nWhile the Jharkhand Academic Council (JAC) often directs students to NCERT\'s ePathshala for e-books, JCERT is responsible for developing curriculums and study materials, and `jacboardsolutions.com` specifically hosts JCERT books[1][2]. The textbooks provided are intended to be up-to-date with contemporary advancements in education[1].\n\nSources:\n[1] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE-Rfp8zVv06axT84YDvuNodyQq0vvAfgnEZFZDQb4VT5LvEYGpjAqiRKLHTCYA6U4AinhE-KVm0kywjQpILJhgEboqirmWl1J07DLgvzSm1eA-OcndkSCTl1QRjDagIP83gveIThX-qWf_1g==)\n[2] [ncertbookspdf.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHIVaNWkkilNHdiVGFFiVIwyMINBhwmKDG4ZST3xdb-yYVGHP7jNRHNxCtaCqJygWQs5JfKLcnkii6w7qhOn_7r2gg0gciu6hbB326nlF9EOMo_030sk-sAyBf9oML4bql5jwA_mqUqwQ0=)"
