    summary: "Net Explanations provides JCERT textbooks in PDF format for Class 1 and Class 2, covering Hindi, English, and Mathematics. These textbooks are available in both Hindi and English mediums[1][2].\n\nSpecifically, for Class 2, you can find direct download links for JCERT Class 2 textbooks for Mathematics, English, and Hindi on the Net Explanations website[1]. Similarly, for Class 1, the website offers JCERT textbooks in PDF files for Hindi, English, Mathematics, and other subjects in both Hindi and English mediums[2]. The books provided are published and distributed by the Jharkhand Council of Educational Research and Training (JCERT)[1][2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHlH0PiYBpS8vTQGeQhWSzDBOPEA85pGvuNcttHyNR4a3itJNTNLkQ7SUKBEUYLZjgi17V8WYnWEI-JamHlQ4rZGl8lFjOuaYKUDAiW7EyqalQp3xUOzqSM_uJuB7fLebBwoYzegGV-CTsYJ3ftC5vT_bE=)\n[2] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF7aa0itFDuT48ky6NEFNLTVHxnpVlJEQjRQToIQpNR1zcp5zHY9xlvn5fpx-ZgTJSBxz9raQ9xl1Spk5goNy67jSZBAVBptF9V8XxX_Cki-DfZ5o_Etw_VUX6LKDnweJeUNBwTjCqKq3fSxGmmfeJv3eI=)"
