    summary: "The \"Sunrise\" textbook for Class 2, published by the Jharkhand Council of Educational Research and Training (JCERT), includes the following units[1]:\n\n*   Unit 0: I Know[1]\n*   Unit 1: Myself[1]\n*   Unit 2: My Daily Routine[1]\n*   Unit 3: My Family[1]\n*   Unit 4: My Friends[1][2]\n*   Unit 5: The Pumpkin and the Cucumber[1]\n*   Unit 6: Three Houses[1]\n*   Unit 7: Pinky Goes to Kolkata[1][3][4] (also \"The Transport Song\"[5])\n*   Unit 8: The Village Market[1]\n*   Unit 9: My School Garden[1][6] (also \"Pretty Flowers\"[7])\n*   Unit 10: Raju Goes to School[1][8]\n\nJCERT is responsible for designing and publishing textbooks for classes 1 to 12 in Jharkhand, and these books are available in both Hindi and English mediums[9][10].\n\nSources:\n[1] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHxzOX1KHojAD-pVPtyjgy9bs5nS-WhfuJH4UnDCfj1YrjZJmoybI2sYbKsAHnGmIbvafQJCdzfYy2g6TISkotKR5aHUDf9eOQJonCwqnD1GfsWEN2buzcCoU6Y5KW6z7jNFEZkzcXvg2fwlsbGzv2nju-PTpVTunda5Ee-Urqrww==)\n[2] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGDhclJ1oZNmVOw_tRs9P3O5pfFtGmnc86wWO3UpkKt8-9LBdPY_hvRAFFwMG2oXK3mLC7c1qE8fzwVBBT9FLUtZsOtR_VZX5TUhlYPJszJnjo9A8pWcfk8NtJhKS3n2VfibDMMqA==)\n[3] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQErJUgmJV_ukATFS6tdH_hapip0Bl7noDXA-pRMtnJuS67u1D49PHM3Vvw1v09xEziLYBHWfFwlqXvuI2lNFTKh4w_VSWMXDwYeNA-ajKF2IoSWpvmkNVglkUMFrO2scBrZo1MrHA==)\n[4] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGSxNbcHukC77J61LcUhNYaVG4v8SmIkn9coMM1pPIW1ZGMzPGxwOiI3DxxECFVrP_yJwx9GYr8ID3hx78OuRPIXBwQr3GzkpcBxXsk2Z_wSlPyTCz0UYccwMdyYqt5pyS3O4rngQ==)\n[5] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGatUAqRg6kIgKb85lbA1E55EtNSZ2jgIHzZQf6gn5dzwTOdMLu2_vGLG4liY8zO1gh2hikrNa1sePXFeK-wGdF_om28vxbLvOV46PVJr6FJh8IZDCa06i26za2r2fTv2BcdXoPnA==)\n[6] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud