    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH8thdVn9D85zqALZSdWFZdDrzHERvm0O5CoJcOBtezg49Vwuw3Xgd5pp3D8bqQLMGRnL1YAiNGpUB26BDiKrcUwHv9wpD2CiKw_igW7DKWiehZIuFvVwQ6UNu6MROeoGuji8_ux_RUpnjrtpRB8W1id0RDtlbpvQ9sFV3LZaQBdmQITrdfSmULpTzkHjljeAj1Q99ACL4KFQkJFsFYr-mpWNBqB9bGQ2Qn2W7aSmRl0JvIFHy1psKu"
      title: "selfstudys.com"
    }
    summary: "\"Sunshine\" is an English textbook for Class 3 students in Jharkhand, published by the Jharkhand Council of Educational Research and Training (JCERT).[1][2] The JCERT provides these textbooks in both English and Hindi mediums.[1]\n\nThe chapters, or units, for \"Sunshine\" Class 3 (English) include:\n*   Unit 1: \"My Dear One\" and \"Hand Washing Day\"[2][3][4]\n*   Unit 2: \"Old McDonald Had A Farm\" and \"Androcles and the Lion\"[2][3]\n*   Unit 3: \"My Teacher\" and \"Who Will Mend My Shoe\"[2][3]\n*   Unit 4: \"Games For Fun\" and \"Dhoni My Hero\"[2][3][5]\n*   Unit 5: \"Holi\" and \"Karma\"[2][3][6]\n*   Unit 6: \"Soldiers\" and \"Veer Budhu Bhagat\"[2][3][7][8]\n*   Unit 7: \"We Are Indians\" and \"Our Country\"[3]\n*   Unit 8: \"Telephone Rings\" and \"Means of Communication\"[3][9]\n*   Unit 9: \"The Rainbow\" and \"Seasons\"[3]\n*   Unit 10: \"Traffic Lights\" and \"A Trip to Raj Bhajan\"[3]\n\nYou can find PDF versions of Jharkhand Board (JAC) Class 3 textbooks, including English, for free download on various educational platforms.[10][1][11][12]\n\nSources:\n[1] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF5oMbotrWfdA9MTsirR74X7sxfIPD52oGknsPQAXLgM4BeOHqpzr6hoeis2dwU1hLIRujYfo8VShSxgm2vW_EJdmY2oWS-SKnklKPTvt6hj0W-QS0z6aDh84oHKiDm660iWhVPqucKKMevsWwWwiakucY=)\n[2] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG64LMoC5bC1Yr9UHK-IAFbC1EBkGJdpcgeJfZHRL70zVrh8VYZL0FwjnawykNd3DcSl60nMmHJfkwKsIXTAwz51926iEoE2eDk2QuVltYww4rexpId4ZxNiM6rW_ru5onx3ylkiPGx8bX-RnXo0P6Sv6LcEeqZ0R7568avmV5Jpw==)\n[3] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGM9-9ZY9iLBkQDw_UfISW1yEshOqpmohXlOeDmTXWNzOcVwAafJ3wY_cvvkaUjN4D5Bxt9jAXmwjXndQDssn0f-2qZllH2m-JedIY_WriDblMAEd2C9QKDW7c3CUZhLmuBSbhfR30=)\n[4] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG5NAKkv5q9_SFRbzRDmINl0QGkBjyd46yEH-NUnfxtCYdR7aaO7hKxzGG94fOpKuwGqIMROR0ZhjB6cvq5AE6C7WMUvhHOt_7q01pMDj2gkZ3XN4QSOgY0sqgwMSYHmDzgVEwL_dQ=)\n[5] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGtei0JPLgnttlAz1F1NVuzH2jjhqFxVQtu0Ly_OI0DERHcONJ2RNtnC5WxOKMzIvaZ-e2PRxaI2LD3tltKHwnDW3qQVQliErdWtt0oaUxVTf3Z_LeAw2KrSE4GvEg1tQwpj8dorkw=)\n[6] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH7_-txUgAaFlvCxY14Lc8chZH29F7EVY6XIrU-T1BuLfR_0layAkZct0XvMj4bRL4WgE1YBSoiBUml5m0I7ARRvCs4-XQwQBisCxhsv6DtKRpVkshKMrYopCz1ZLyOMMkqGwETC68=)\n[7] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFJc_FG626LiQYOkHysekoOrQweNbuGVyvId1vxYJNKuWGdn6BPdV49y4I2Q60bePWqrLFMEcpA2bvrtTzpOdPbtYmrOgXlI6Qwa-TOQD_qNHNhhwOC8dmN6_Yp_5ieAMj6bsV5W2A=)\n[8] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE6iC53mQiMN9SO2_dJf84od0Zuidqc-dZRZwiRgtp4XaTckvLqRlyzzl3PiTPPy0Q1yYCMu1z0nuFMmdF5i-bxvGJqeYmROC3_XPRgQpTmMIbpn5e6BPsrPSt7Igh9-1N8PzeumnY=)\n[9] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEelf0sRtTTbcBMZIC3RKFfbpjF7T4Op2mDsWqi600F4OoBxUNjyCF-gXIIY4k1-9MwCnWqoaXPreKsSJv4r7Re0DCWnj4lRcOk7EDkXzhP9YQfuuliB5GlVx8MN6jYIwGfnFsqs5k=)\n[10] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFUVkv-E_o18LTFgZEtVYDUjzBgr70wTC-27iBSrKyHh14FHTpYG_bp9A8GIXlvsd-DgFpC7hDcbmSIqDfiEsX8stAtuIbXCB73eyNmAtcOppRaDlIF2uzw-YyXnzZFiQ-ei76dujA02rMb0UEyAmSddLVdPw==)\n[11] [byjus.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE87vfXJ1FQFHkJHVuAN3mVB5pJ93RIIzxub77g3laiWWO1nqXmyH903CVF_knVZyrobYVc658QqPgLuC2Ugg4eXOI4KYObap8nTz3WngP6831iIQ8tN1_vFp3Wre7voQ==)\n[12] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH8thdVn9D85zqALZSdWFZdDrzHERvm0O5CoJcOBtezg49Vwuw3Xgd5pp3D8bqQLMGRnL1YAiNGpUB26BDiKrcUwHv9wpD2CiKw_igW7DKWiehZIuFvVwQ6UNu6MROeoGuji8_ux_RUpnjrtpRB8W1id0RDtlbpvQ9sFV3LZaQBdmQITrdfSmULpTzkHjljeAj1Q99ACL4KFQkJFsFYr-mpWNBqB9bG