    summary: "\"Sunshine\" is an English textbook for Class 4 students in Jharkhand, published by the Jharkhand Council of Educational Research and Training (JCERT). These textbooks are part of the curriculum for the Jharkhand Academic Council (JAC) board[1][2][3].\n\nThe \"Sunshine\" textbook for Class 4 includes various units and chapters. Some of the units identified are:\n*   Unit 1: The Stars; Sky and Her Children[4][5]\n*   Unit 2: Frogs at School; The Clever Fishes[6][4][5]\n*   Unit 3: Love for Nation; Pride of India[4][5]\n*   Unit 4: The Land of Rising Sun; A Trip to Japan[4][5]\n*   Unit 5: A Wonderful Place; Gulliver and the Lilliputians[4][5]\n*   Unit 6: Games and Sports; Playing in a Lane; Let\'s Play Carrom Board[4][5]\n*   Unit 7: Sun\'s Family; Wonderful Flying Machine[4][5]\n*   Unit 8: Peace; The People\'s President[5][7]\n*   Unit 9: Chhau: A Martial Dance; Sarhul: A Festival of Nature[5][8]\n*   Unit 10: To A Friend In Wonderland; Cell Phone[9][5]\n\nThese textbooks are available for download in PDF format on various educational websites, providing resources for students in both English and Hindi mediums[2][10][3].\n\nSources:\n[1] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEx4me4NANEiFaSnCO3Fx25I7T2R8LsFj9mP-YQCm0C29Nvgj17G1PaE2EEh0akY_kVEBN1ojCFtxeOhiBTTIerZm-jI90VPe8i260p096IkogTuO_SMlXxYSOHak8q4VF8oOAsqHY=)\n[2] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQE8Ifnl_DJ6Nq--2O-yt1kcQeSJ5bPmcWOb8RsJStpVprCpNMfyk8rO4jro2lm0kfDJrklvhpaFeVKL6NgHDpk9GzQybPGLMJcWZUJhLOk4QV5NDNLJTIEmqkAENtzIZ869_6Pdu15vx8ZpZDm0e5G99lw=)\n[3] [jacportal.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGq-1NlRnZWE99nIE5C-eg6BFv6CbOtAW-VoFDAkaJv2WWjaCziGo8yDDqMJG0x6UakMEOM-pk7XQZmXlpeVjN9uwxqXj-c0PZj2NvfGlNMm29IwOXAyZLXjVdrEMDmiw==)\n[4] [thestudyclassroom.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHR-Zzt6sZ5ato6ZkP_NhmWtvc3nU8skWyd5o0s5NaOYhQbbMpwPCyUFlztfvyoUQuQc-reig5Ph_ad0AKnjsvT5VGV3XUvWdYPPoguH-3exZ9KrSd0w-3VM_Ul_DM1kxk48cQ8BQJkD01kCT4mJQJDZs8nFz-9LbYghZOX4HAG)\n[5] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHLXl8dh4zCgOQm_lFOYj3MQ_xeaeG3HY7GFO-DdaYzx7rFWSV5dbXepF7ZpRzHZNIr0Hes-mJ006M9K61fq1lxHjMjfh0sDcHxHGfHya_XGs4POpjntSQtBKeeNsEGaAdzaR1Eacw=)\n[6] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF_e1NP5vgE3NGviULU_aekGF2NsZV_ZVSUh-sIilE4i33-X8EFk0k3cqyV78DNafVmJ0VC6VCMng1gXYG9wJm6SBjWH72Re750yd9MWbNE3ljeG4SX5BU8LuGijabTptUYDfC3-Fw=)\n[7] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHCZ6mdtY5xKwwdix1UUIRxaEbHg4fYUgI5LVte1OQOeRgr1E6qquzXKrkFUiq8P3RD4bnCt6uAIcu9a16FeX9mtuAi3pvmGVqQm-0QimHnDIMNacTmq3Ble3Azv4tHxo96yfq4E3I=)\n[8] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHkJ55xV4gFJlCF0Kv0_D3mtLdkK4hRSAMOAN081VH-1WPFvVyi-otQC36sfypAQ2yhe7rXtrp-Op1yAszNmNFDawFq8JgQXW5Ttxl40wSVndHB-UJSqZQpKCJsK5GfsIDuj-HHvrE=)\n[9] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHtfm_z5gt-gaqOJJwo0pyTadrEg2nS8HN3IV2aRo06Efznj4JBVbILRcsGg587mNks04q3qM_ABWouQ3yMMnAhmtQr-z6P2squyGc5Sskm0tqkvif01GAvDR-OAJhtfTBzdA0at2g=)\n[10] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH08gypdlS7VnsnNjqH-ogNK6xFWASxqLAaHeiXd8WBW-EBOkzqYUYR1tQFOSCNfaKel3rgvwlELuPU9nzFWzgGmpCrxoYkabVbHVZ6ezLQYbYgcGVLZHnsVQAV2Xa8lEtfBtcLZHFXJwJz9zVAU-0lQYY4NA==)"
