    summary: "The \"Sunshine\" textbook is the English textbook for Class 5 students under the Jharkhand Council of Educational Research & Training (JCERT) in Jharkhand, India[1][2][3]. The JCERT provides PDF download links for these textbooks, including \"Sunshine \342\200\223 III\" for English[1].\n\nHere are some of the chapters or units found in the \"Sunshine\" Class 5 English textbook:\n*   **Unit 1: Good Night and Good Morning** (Poem) and **The Wooden Bowl** (Prose)[4][5][6][7]\n*   **Unit 2: A Blind Child Speaks** (Poem) and **Golu goes to school** (Prose)[4][5][6]\n*   **Unit 3: My Nation** (Poem) and **Republic Day Parade** (Prose)[4][5][8][6]\n*   **Unit 4: Save the World** (Poem) and **The Bamboo Princess** (Prose)[4][9][5][6][10]\n*   **Unit 5: The Swing** (Poem) and **Bravery award** (Prose)[4][11][5][12]\n*   **Unit 6: Mud on the Nose** (Poem) and **The Cricket Match** (Prose)[4][5]\n*   **Unit 7: Our friend: Computer** (Prose)[4][13][5]\n*   Other chapters/units mentioned include \"Science\" (Unit 6)[14], \"Peace, Love and Harmony\", \"Mother Teresa\", and \"Our culture, our pride\"[5].\n\nThe Jharkhand Academic Council (JAC) also provides a dedicated portal for textbooks and study resources for students from Class 1 to 12, offering free PDF books[1]. The syllabus for Class 5 English for the academic year 2024-25 is also available on the official JCERT website[6].\n\nSources:\n[1] [jacportal.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGz228eZaBqCIljVTyPyQ9eXcGuFzUvFAYtDIxGU9CDvFT8zN1NfMbfOfrn8fxRktqM6L-iqZp_RIUsxqcUo5mldVr6IiD4TexTyKgmVNSmuAg8P4ClzHtX9ENa4DEJWA==)\n[2] [selfstudys.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEsWkZpoaYH5gm5-QL7VzLSKjslPh5Od1zSXKq9bZ52OrviH9XkwKyGcjX_JvleOBE1YlmivIpIod_sMnC6XYn9fLCKzbWI0cVnCL7O7JIp5xCDo4qLDAAPR7SoxBtWVJP7CTu5mf7fb04kK54I_kJ-9EsD4w==)\n[3] [jacboardsolutions.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGAwalPJRvL9rRowgLZ1hfULoJdR6cXCqY0vTEJ1fJUDVAhz3200fu5cRGWnmEM3sr6vBIOPuf0OMyiNz42KPCZUVi1MCWxpjr1Fwe6AqnuVQMCDCYt6Z0WCDXPPZbHOOuvuKJBmbXmB5iZkHKFGS5IQZG8464A_yLUMXc=)\n[4] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQES8Ou4VA2rpdhAo4w0ZMa2gcSKIfpL0xQFkNir1A6ba6f9sqU1i426mshCXG4sGVoXF7UWu0luVYHoMbR3XgneU_3ExsgFOR390juhKWpGvXdu4bbVzJbQAZJ7rSzjHqFb64sfLWx9xOujGnmcT2z18TTW4buOAM_9hm85VTvyPw==)\n[5] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGQCOUOtehcTXjOcnvsvc4DGwqP4AUqTDQ6FpZynwWsOFhTKFtdnMgEKrMcwtcaIrt9W5Os1BsxG6aSlHmuAWPzV88tu9yZafsYpUCobe1yRWvd4WzlpsUI985bnI4erJ0t4zAXLeI=)\n[6] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEGyRlSMBeFrWK2b7sO-O5JaPaEAFpa6YvDXnnFTw3dywIT8qdselTWGhUXa0HM5sZZ4aofdmgYE-ebNU_T42HQgLbz2l_1f716EWNg7BZc3rFUePelwbyIsYODWwtSWwl3fOqbdoL0EimD-e1qLsiGzu15XAwD2hA=)\n[7] [netexplanations.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH2AVtQTzZ3YMTD9qWVBPKYX085k75XImr1VWZZk4lVLP_x4wIecCtq7EUDkU4LrA8zNpZFfvPxbQ5RLZaDhQUyZHbPhv2axxJg8X1Tug98JqN-AoMU2hjNeRVGrtyUMehxkQfrqe1iiFNiEAy24lpkbEPH2UB66-cGqmAn9A7HOwiSz0Slb6lsK-lZJzbY9g==)\n[8] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH2Hx4oS2Qhc1gOvlgBwrDpFdJ7EVekNS09JVvPBdetfF-KsGkpN-zHC1GTN9bwy6DYeuG1NHOtBxo9BAY0o-WklWJXA6Ms2J1744cW3JHBB6An_08THOBcegG1LWYiEJLiRwAUtPo=)\n[9] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFakaOq__xkuzzmyRavBY6IBGJXF-E5WAT0LdJ-YN8RanxGv0uUQYsFtjxFXwJXHmwRoWwdurONRwyRjZmjBjQ3ElLLBRszZxeu8LWuKKJPT3KcL3d4sNhD7zQPWxbRkhYApBnyAg0=)\n[10] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGpylbGYVophUQ8FX5JideESKoc-N5PB1QebScytErpCYa09D09J9utoZjKvrumkoNHWagIKncWxWWHKsBadDxhTbU0Sm9FAO1s7BWBK1UDjmv0ctuqfgqFmgKDbeF9EhV3RFIaH3s=)\n[11] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGTYUs6xnv5VxtJZlGVEjd4m2l