    summary: "The website \"thestudyclassroom.com\" contains content related to \"\340\244\235\340\244\277\340\244\262\340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\262\", \"bhashanjali\", and \"jcert\" for various classes.\n\nSpecifically, the site features:\n*   **Class 2 new \340\244\235\340\244\277\340\244\262\340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\262 \342\200\223 2 (\340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\250\340\245\215\340\244\246\340\245\200) Jcert Books** with a list of 12 chapters covering topics like \"\340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\260\340\244\276 \340\244\265\340\244\277\340\244\246\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\244\276\340\244\262\340\244\257\", \"\340\244\206\340\244\210 \340\244\217\340\244\225 \340\244\226\340\244\274\340\244\254\340\244\260\", \"\340\244\256\340\245\210\340\244\202 \340\244\255\340\245\200\", and \"\340\244\260\340\244\270\340\245\213\340\244\210 \340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\202 \340\244\255\340\244\227\340\244\246\340\244\241\340\244\274\"[1].\n*   **Class 5 new \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 (\340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\250\340\245\215\340\244\246\340\245\200) Jcert Books** which includes chapters such as \"\340\244\271\340\244\256 \340\244\270\340\244\254 \340\244\270\340\245\201\340\244\256\340\244\250 \340\244\217\340\244\225 \340\244\211\340\244\252\340\244\265\340\244\250 \340\244\225\340\245\207 (\340\244\225\340\244\265\340\244\277\340\244\244\340\244\276)\", \"\340\244\253\340\244\270\340\244\262\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\225\340\244\276 \340\244\244\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\245\213\340\244\271\340\244\276\340\244\260 (\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\254\340\244\202\340\244\247)\", and \"\340\244\210\340\244\246\340\244\227\340\244\276\340\244\271 (\340\244\225\340\244\271\340\244\276\340\244\250\340\245\200)\"[2].\n*   **Class 3 new \340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 (\340\244\271\340\244\277\340\244\202\340\244\246\340\245\200) Jcert Books** with chapters like \"\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\262\340\244\227\340\244\276\340\244\241\340\244\274\340\245\200\", \"\340\244\225\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\245\202\340\244\270\", and \"\340\244\223 \340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\260\340\245\200 \340\244\256\340\244\233\340\244\262\340\245\200\"[3].\n\nWhile direct links to \"thestudyclassroom.com\" for all requested classes (1-5) and keywords are not explicitly provided in the search results, there is mention of JCERT Class 4 textbooks, available in PDF format for Mathematics, English, and Hindi, designed to promote student growth and curiosity[4]. These books are published by the Jharkhand Council of Educational Research and Training. Another result shows a YouTube video titled \"Class - 4 Bhashanjali, Lesson - 3 When Papa was a child\", which is relevant to \"Bhashanjali\" and Class 4, though not directly on \"thestudyclassroom.com\"[5].\n\nSources:\n[1] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGVrs40IMQ0Ox5BOUoKTzH4FsK_IJIbamoXoJu3BWlRPQ18SHODuofox_fl6sunZJrRnbSHMCye1m2fRnL14vbqZqzk4YhERrV_8-TrdEW_HyZ_5_DOZ25vvHv5Fq9X2l8gsuxXWgGh5_OHDOH4UNSqHeAzeQIxD6Niyylm9LJu4rUTPUpPye7e4RwjLcrGGUxIHsG_T6QpLslVMS_-85U2M7rYje0AUPVOi9a9bTRKjAWCgGYvggeuYSKwxn8j_UDrTkWU1rlns1zudcTYPRs6ZWtkC35aXQ_pHH02Y6mS9g==)\n[2] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEP8jPBG-oa74wCKso5OsCkwFlQEiBFhDgBFPAuZvEK1_kru8tJVBjPiO_X0gXEo67IW8C-bWu8A2REvP9mkZiemMjFGsAQAMez1L8HorTZwWKiw5PsjP3fGvC03NVaLtHmMOL82UxbTaaENp7Ew4R43nmdeVqAXjE8ZYJZIsaP6nY7uC1iGKZbAVXrmORp7kVqdSn3BbMA2IKimQvIgmavzs8yleHfqTap5Znz4FwXGLe_8zIRCQ84wFnRtOUrTZFjRlEsl2xBShXTj_WGbj6DT-wZNUQoRJk5ZuYl44W4WMLDSJ97LMcIka2ai6_FMOA=)\n[3] [wordpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFh0n-sJB9jMKhdVkrkQwxY7iIpK_Sir-2_qUM06ktz_I0IiJxNjQ7xbElJZrGpjO6C9iBpgS1kbdW_oEYpPCrE6Rn_NAc9H04F46AWUDvVQ8J5JmQtJg9zk35RYD-PFEP17D8z5