  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Curriculum Structure**\n\nOkay, I\'m diving deep into the Jharkhand JCERT curriculum for primary classes. It\'s a goldmine of information! My focus is to analyze the official subjects taught in the state\'s JCERT primary curriculum. I\'m excited to identify the core subjects taught in Classes 1 through 5, and their relative importance. I have found the official subjects in the curriculum.\n\n\n**Listing Curriculum Content**\n\nI\'ve got the subjects mapped out, and I\'m currently working on a deeper dive to analyze the specifics, and note the distinct books prescribed for each of these core subjects in Classes 1 through 5. It\'s fascinating to see how the curriculum is structured across the primary grades. I\'ve noted down the corresponding book names.\n\n\n"
