  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing User Feedback**\n\nI\'m now diving into the user\'s core feedback. Specifically, I\'m focusing on the accuracy of subject and chapter alignment with the Jharkhand/JCERT textbook. The UI and animation are a hit, but the data needs serious scrutiny. My priority now is mapping the correct information from that textbook with current classes. This data integrity is key, and I\342\200\231m ready to start the fix.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Data Accuracy**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on data accuracy in light of this new government mandate. It\'s now very clear that strict adherence to the JCERT/Jharkhand textbooks is non-negotiable across all classes. My focus is entirely on ensuring the chapter titles, numbers, and order precisely match the official books, and the plan for the data file is confirmed. The priority is data integrity.\n\n\n**Verifying Textbook Alignment**\n\nI\'m now deep in the process of ensuring our data accurately reflects the official JCERT Jharkhand textbooks. Specifically, I\'m verifying the alignment for Class 1 Mathematics. The chapters, \"\340\244\260\340\245\213\340\244\232\340\244\225 \340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 - 1\" from the book must match our content precisely. The goal is pinpoint alignment, even down to the chapter names and their order. I\'m focusing on \"Mathematics\" chapters 1-10 to ensure the accuracy.\n\n\n**Confirming Subject Details**\n\nI\'ve moved on to meticulously checking other subjects. I\'ve now confirmed the details for Hindi, English, and Mathematics, specifically mapping the chapters of \"\340\244\235\340\244\277\340\244\262\340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\262 - 1\" (Jhilmil - 1) in Hindi, \"Sunrise - 1\" in English, and mathematics. I am ensuring that the chapters and units align exactly with the prescribed JCERT Jharkhand textbooks for Class 1. I\'m focusing on ensuring accuracy in chapter names and numbers.\n\n\n**Mapping Class 2 Content**\n\nI\'m now cross-referencing Class 2\'s Mathematics textbook, \"\340\244\260\340\245\213\340\244\232\340\244\225 \340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 - 2\", against our data. I\'ve begun to list the chapters: \"\340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\244\276 \340\244\271\340\245\210 \340\244\262\340\244\202\340\244\254\340\244\276, \340\244\225\340\245\215\340\244\257\340\244\276 \340\244\271\340\245\210 \340\244\227\340\245\213\340\244\262?\", \"\340\244\227\340\244\277\340\244\250\340\245\213 \340\244\256\340\244\227\340\244\260 \340\244\270\340\244\256\340\245\202\340\244\271\340\245\213\340\244\202 \340\244\256\340\245\207\340\244\202\", and \"\340\244\244\340\245\201\340\244\256 \340\244\225\340\244\277\340\244\244\340\244\250\340\244\276 \340\244\265\340\244\234\340\244\274\340\244\250 \340\244\211\340\244\240\340\244\276 \340\244\270\340\244\225\340\244\244\340\245\207 \340\244\271\340\245\213?\". My current focus is aligning our existing content with those listed. Now, I\'m working to verify that each chapter name and topic perfectly mirrors the original text for exactness.\n\n\n**Matching Chapter Alignments**\n\nI\'m now comparing our content against \"\340\244\260\340\245\213\340\244\232\340\244\225 \340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 - 2\" and \"\340\244\235\340\244\277\340\244\262\340\244\256\340\244\277\340\244\262 - 2\" textbooks for Class 2. For math, I\'ve listed chapters from \"Lines and Lines\" through \"How Many Ponytails.\" I\'m also ensuring \"Mera Vidyalay\" through \"Sarhul\" from Hindi accurately reflect the Jharkhand JCERT textbooks. My priority is to match each chapter name, number, and content with the original for precision.\n\n\n**Verifying New Textbooks**\n\nI\'m now cross-referencing Class 2 English and Class 3 textbooks. For Class 2, I\'m checking \"Sunrise - 2\" chapters, from \"I Know\" to \"Raju Goes to School.\" Then, for Class 3, I\'m reviewing \"\340\244\260\340\245\213\340\244\232\340\244\225 \340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 - 3