  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Class 3 Curriculum**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the curriculum structure for Class 3. I\'ve begun defining the core materials, and I\'m adding the textbook details. For Mathematics, it will be \"\340\244\260\340\245\213\340\244\232\340\244\225 \340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 - 3\" with its 12 chapters. I\'m also including the Hindi textbook, \"\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 - 3,\" containing 16 chapters, starting with \"\340\244\260\340\245\207\340\244\262\340\244\227\340\244\276\340\244\241\340\244\274\340\245\200\".\n\n\n**Listing Textbook Units**\n\nI am currently working to list specific units within each textbook. Specifically, I\'ve outlined the content within the textbooks \"Sunshine - 3\" and \"\340\244\271\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\245\200 \340\244\246\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276 - 1\". I have also added \"Sunshine - 3\" contains 10 units, and \"\340\244\271\340\244\256\340\244\276\340\244\260\340\245\200 \340\244\246\340\245\201\340\244\250\340\244\277\340\244\257\340\244\276 - 1\" contains 10 chapters.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_25938"
      name: "write_to_file"
