  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Creating Class 4 Data**\n\nI\'m now generating the `curriculumClass4.ts` file. Class 4\'s curriculum is based on JCERT Jharkhand textbooks. The primary text is \"\340\244\260\340\245\213\340\244\232\340\244\225 \340\244\227\340\244\243\340\244\277\340\244\244 - 4\", which features 13 chapters. These cover geometry, numbers, addition, subtraction, multiplication, and practice exercises.\n\n\n**Analyzing Curriculum Data**\n\nI\'ve moved on to analyzing the Class 4 curriculum data further. My focus has shifted to the Hindi and English language textbooks. Hindi, \"**\340\244\255\340\244\276\340\244\267\340\244\276\340\244\202\340\244\234\340\244\262\340\244\277 - 4**\", has 13 chapters, covering poems and stories. The English textbook, \"**Sunshine - 4**\", features 10 units with diverse content, from stories about nations to fables. I\'m noting the topics covered in each.\n\n\n"
